<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Gaˈanda</book>
  <para style="h">1 Korintiyawa</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Kor</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Corinthians</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tǝrkwathl kan yarati Bulus Kǝmɗi Romawecha</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 Corinthians</para>
  <para style="is">Tǝrkwathl kan yarati Bulus kǝmɗi Korintiyawecha</para>
  <para style="ib">Tǝrkwathl kan ndikta</para>
  <para style="ili">Thla yarech tǝrkwathl kan ndiktǝɗiya kǝmɗi Korintiyawecha, mǝthlan nech kǝ Bulus tatǝ kimsha i Yesu. Yarechan ɗelwertǝɗiya fartǝɗi natǝn tǝ chok tǝ ǝ mǝrǝɓ Afisa, ǝ hurech kum chǝt ɗǝrman nggǝrsǝ ɗǝrman (55), kǝrsǝ nggǝtti Yesu.</para>
  <para style="im">Yarech Bulus ɗelwertǝɗa kǝthlǝm kǝ tǝɗanchi thlǝmatˈyanda kǝ ɓǝra ɓillachǝ thlaˈchǝ samǝn samǝn. Tǝ hur incha yi kuɓandǝ fata samǝn samǝn, thla nechsi hur nanda fǝ fǝr kit cha. Fen tǝɗi fǝrchǝ kit tǝmɗi ɓasi Bulus.</para>
  <para style="im">Ə thlǝhaɗan Korinti kapa mǝrɓa thla sǝndǝ fee anchi tǝ hur inchi samǝn samǝn. Hur inchiɗa paɗ fen nech kǝ, hiyandǝ kaɗi tǝ hita. Thlǝ kweˈchandǝ ha tǝ kaa hurinda, tǝ sǝn ǝna. Kweˈtǝ ha tǝ para raˈatˈyanda, tǝ fǝlaukǝta, kapaɗan fǝlaukǝtɗi mbancha raˈatˈyandǝ fa. Ɗelwertaˈan ndik kǝ ɓǝra chak tǝ ha pǝthlǝr nafcha fǝ fǝr kit. Tǝ tar fǝlaukǝɗ ɗi naa fowun huran. Tǝ mǝk wan har raˈan thla thlǝ na fowun chǝta ǝ pangngǝn fǝ chak mi cha fee nawakchǝ kǝ fǝ fǝr kit cha. Tǝ paɗ saa feri Chinda thla thlǝ naa fowun chǝta tǝ mbanɗi kǝmwak chǝsi. Tǝ kǝɗu paɗ, tahǝssi chǝt ɗelwertaˈan kǝ ɓǝra chaˈandǝ kaɗi yi lekta thla thlǝ naa fee chita kǝ ɓǝra thlaˈti mǝmatecha. Ə nggǝlmiyan Bulus pin wa wanɓǝɓi ɓilla chiɗi nech ǝ Korinti ya ndaˈan nech kǝ, kǝ pǝnandǝ raˈan yahraˈan tǝɗi thlǝt nda mǝɗi Farta.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ichiɗi nech hur yaraɗan</para>
  <para style="ip">Ndaˈina tǝ shenuˈtǝ tǝ Farta 1:1-9</para>
  <para style="ip">Chak tǝ ha pǝthlǝr nafcha fǝ fǝr kit 1:10--4:21</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɓilla kǝ ɓǝra thlǝrɗakta 5:1--7:40</para>
  <para style="ip">Manandǝ Farta mǝni manandǝ ɗǝhacha 8:1--11:1</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbanɗi naa fee manandǝ Farta 11:2--14:40</para>
  <para style="ip">Thlaˈti Yesu ǝ mǝrta, tǝ yi fǝ fǝr kit 15:1-58</para>
  <para style="ip">Fǝr icha kǝthlǝm fǝ fǝr kit chiɗi nech ǝ thle Yahudiya 16:1-4</para>
  <para style="ip">Ndukwa ndikta tǝ ndaˈina 16:5-24</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="s">Ndan Bulus ǝn nafchǝ Korinti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Ɗelwer tǝɗiya thlaˈtǝ mǝɗinchi Bulus, thla ˈya Farta ndǝ tǝ yahtiyan paɗ kǝ choki kǝ kimsha i Yesu Kǝristi. Wanmanmǝn Sastanisu mǝthlan mǝɗiya tǝ nggǝta.<verse eid="1CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />Nggǝt thlǝnowun ɗelwer tǝɗiya kun fǝ tǝr mbanchi Farta, fee nech ǝ mǝrɓi Korinti, fee hǝlengnga ndǝ fee kaɗi paɗ ˈya fee tanda kǝ nandǝ chǝɗchǝɗ mǝɗi Farta. Ɓukwa tǝ fee nech chik ǝ ayi thlǝ nech ˈyata tǝ thlǝm Chinmǝn Yesu Kǝristi, Chǝnnanda tǝ yimǝn nat.<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Kafata tǝ chok hashas kǝta kǝ chok tǝ wunchi thlaˈtǝ mǝɗi Farta Chimǝn, tǝ yi Chinda Yesu Kǝristi.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chan Bulus usoko Farta kǝthlǝm mbǝs ǝnaɗi fǝrandǝn nafcha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Thlǝ chanchi usoko Farta chika kwati kǝthlǝm kun, kǝthlǝm kafati Farta, thla mbǝsowundǝ fee tǝmɗi Kǝristi Yesu. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Nat tǝ chik yen mbanda chowunɗǝ fee wurmaktǝ ǝ huran, tǝmɗi shenuˈta tǝ hurˈindǝ nat <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Kǝthlǝm ǝ wathlan Farta ha ndat wa ǝnɗi mbuˈtǝmǝn kǝ ɗar Yesu Kǝristi, thla sǝk tǝwun, chok ha ǝ hurwun. <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan, kuɓawowun mbǝs chǝka yen kǝnau pafǝn i Shemeti Farta wa, nat wun pǝkta tǝ kwalfata, fartǝɗi naa fee pǝn Chinmǝn Yesu Kǝristi. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Chǝnmǝn nan ɗǝf wunchi kǝ nowun kwaˈkwa kǝ ndukwaɗan. Kǝthlǝm kǝ chok wun kǝ ǝna aiˈ ǝ fartǝ ɓati Chinm`ǝn Yesu Kǝristi kaɗ wa. Kǝthlǝm kǝ thlewunchi Farta chak mee ˈyan ndat wa chǝwun ɓǝɓifata wa. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Farta thlǝ ndiɗanchan ɗǝf mee ˈyan ha, mǝthlan ˈyech wunchi kǝ chok wun nggitkekta tǝ waˈyan Yesu Kǝristi, Chinmǝn.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chak tǝ ha hur wum indi fǝtǝr mbancha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Wanmanchina, nggǝt shiyowunnda, kǝthlǝm thlǝm Chinmǝn Yesu Kǝristi, ndat wa, kǝn meˈyowun arta kǝ ɗar ǝnɗi thlǝ mbuˈtǝwun. Kǝ ɓǝ chak tǝ ha kǝ pǝthlǝr wun wa, wumaman inda, kǝn kaɗatˈyowun tǝ saktiyowun artǝ paɗ. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Wanmanchina hǝssǝ tǝ nǝssa, fowun nafchi thla wiri Kuluwi, mbaˈichindǝ tǝ ndat wa, thlǝ nech fowun nafchǝ as indǝ tǝ raˈan hur wun. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Ənɗi nati mbuˈta, ndat wa chaktǝs ha pǝthlǝrwun. Fowun thlǝ nechandǝ mbuˈta wa “Ngǝt yi Bulus naki,” Yowun paɗ ndakan wa, “Ngǝt yi Apolos naki,” Yowun paɗ ndakan wa, “Ngǝt yi Kefas naki,” Yowun paɗ ndakan wa, “Ngǝt yi Kǝristi naki.” <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Awi, ǝ chak kǝristi ha wa? Ndu Bulus kukwandǝ fee ha kǝthlǝm kun wa? Ndu chowunchi fee baptisma tǝ thlǝm Bulus wa? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Chani usoko Farta, chawi yowun baptisma hurwun wa, manga Kǝrisbus tǝ Gayus wa. <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />Tǝ kǝɗu nefsi nech ndat nakanya wa tǝ thlǝmna cha ndǝ fee baptisma wa. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />(Kuɗukinchi paɗ, chani nafchi wiri Istifanus baptisma, paɗ maangga fee yawa, ni kuɗuk ndu chani yowun baptisma wa.) <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Ai, ngga thlǝn chi Yesu nenchi kǝthlǝm kǝ chani baptisma nafcha wa, paɗ thlǝn chan nenchi kǝ ɓasi kwastǝ ndikti Farta yi sǝkta kǝmɗi nafcha. Ngga kǝ mbu i tǝ ɗathla ndu tǝ mbǝr shenuˈ tinchǝ wa, kǝthlǝm kǝ kuɓan fee naa alkǝt mǝrtǝ Yesu ɗar palang nda wa.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kǝristi nech kǝ mbǝr ǝna tǝ alkǝti Farta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Ndiktǝ mǝrti Yesu ǝ ɗar palang nda, chok chan kǝ ɓamkǝta kǝmɗi fee nech mǝrtǝ hur ɓǝɓifechˈyanda. Nggǝmǝn tǝɗi thlǝ naa fee hǝraˈa mǝnda, kǝthlǝm kǝ mbǝsmǝn shishingdǝ kǝ kweˈkǝchi, chok chan kǝ alkǝti Farta. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Kǝthlǝm nechan kǝ yaraɗan hur ndikti Farta ndat wa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">“Ni timandǝ mbǝrˈǝni fǝ mbǝrˈǝnicha.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 1:19">Ni paˈandǝ sǝnˈǝni fǝ sǝnˈǝnichǝ kaɗi.”<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Kǝɗu, fǝ mbǝrˈichǝ ayi? Ai, paɗ fǝ chaˈanchi kussiˈ i Musa kaɗi? Ai, fee thlǝ nech ndat wa sǝn ɗǝ chikami nat yuwa heshiɗiya? Awi pǝnwǝ Farta wa mbǝrˈǝni fǝ mbǝrˈǝnicha yi heshiɗiya ɓamkǝta wa? <verse eid="1CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Farta tǝmɗi mbǝr ǝn ˈyan, nggǝmawa kǝ sǝn nafchi ndi tǝmɗi mbǝrˈǝn ˈyanda wa. Tǝ kǝɗu taɗ Farta kǝ hǝraˈanchǝ fee thlǝ fǝr chǝ kit kǝmɗiyan tǝmɗi kwastǝ ndikta mbinchan yi sǝkta thla thlǝ natmǝn ɓasandǝ kaɗi, thla thlǝ naa fee nat paɗ kǝɗ ɓamkǝta. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Yahudawecha, ǝna sakaˈincha thlǝ nat ndǝ kata kǝ nannda kǝthlǝm kǝ fǝr ndǝ kit kǝ anchi, Helenawecha paɗ mbǝr ǝn ndak yahtǝ ndǝs kǝ mbǝsnda. <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />Nggamǝn paɗ, tǝnamǝn ɓas Kristi thla mǝrchǝ ǝ ɓǝra palangnda, ǝnɗi chokchǝ kǝ ɗakwan che wansarta kǝmɗi Yahudawecha, ǝna ɓamkǝt paɗ kǝmɗi fee nawakchǝ kǝ Yahudawecha. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Paɗ kǝmɗi fee ˈya Farta, ndu Yahudawecha ndu fee nawakchǝ kǝ Yahudawecha, Kǝristi nech kǝ alkǝta tǝ mbǝr ǝni Farta. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Kǝthlǝm ǝnɗi naa fee kǝɗ chǝ Farta ɓamkǝta, mbǝrantǝ mbǝr ǝni pong nef ha, kumi alkǝti Farta ɗǝbandǝ nefa, mbǝrantǝ alkǝtɗi nessi pong nef ha.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Wanmanchina hǝssǝ tǝ nǝssa, kaɗam har kunmicha fartǝɗi ˈya Farta wunchi. Ngguɗyeh hurwun nech kǝ fǝ mbǝrˈicha kǝ ɗar nati pong nef ha. Ngguɗyeh paɗ hurwun nech tǝ kapa manda. Ngguɗyeh nech kǝ wanchi paktecha. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Paɗ Farta thlǝ taɗchan ǝnɗi ɗǝpandǝ nafcha wa ǝna ɓamkǝta hur heshiɗiya, kǝthlǝm kǝ fǝrantǝ hartǝ fat fǝ mbǝr icha. Thlǝ taɗchǝ Farta ǝnɗi thlǝ naa nafcha wa kǝɗ tǝ wulanchi, kǝthlǝm kǝ fǝrantǝ hartǝ fat fee nech tǝ alkǝtfa. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Taɗ chi Farta ichiɗi nawakchi kǝ ǝna hur heshiɗiya. Ichiɗi jirandǝ fee kaɗi tǝ ǝnɗi nawakchǝ kǝ ǝna, kǝ chok ndǝ ǝ pangngǝn ichiɗi ɗǝbandǝ nafcha wa ndiˈchan. <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />Chich Farta ichiɗa nat kǝthlǝm kǝ ndǝ yowun wa nan thlaˈan tǝ inda ǝ pangngǝn nan wa. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Kǝthlǝm Farta ɓet tǝmǝnchi kǝ chok mǝn kǝ yi Yesu Kristi. Mǝthlan ɗǝfchǝ Kǝristi paɗ kǝ chok kǝ mbǝr ǝn ˈyamǝn. Tǝmɗi Kǝristi nawaktǝ ǝn fiyamǝn pangngǝn Farta. Chok mǝn chǝɗchǝɗ mǝɗi Farta tǝ fee hǝraˈandǝ fee tanda. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan, “Kǝɗ ǝnɗi natǝn kǝ yaraɗan, nat thla yahchǝ kǝ hupantǝ kirsha, kǝ hupantǝ kirsha hur Chinda Yesu.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s">Ndikta kǝ ɓǝra mǝrti Yesu ɓǝra palangnda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Wanmanchina hǝssǝ tǝ nǝssa, fartǝɗi ɓati kǝmɗiyowun kǝ ɓasowunchi wubtǝ ǝnɗi mbuˈamǝn ndǝ Farta, mbuˈowun wi ichiɗa tǝmɗi mbǝr shenuˈta ndu pǝn mbǝrˈǝna wa. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Fartǝɗi nati choktǝ tǝ wunchi, thlarani ha wanɗǝkaɗatinchi wa, mǝ sǝni ǝn samǝn wa maangga Kǝristi Yesu ndak tǝ mǝrtiyan ɓǝra palangnda wa. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Ɓechi kǝmɗiyowun tǝ kumi alkǝtfa, ngǝt rǝɓ fata tǝ lekǝta. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />Ichiɗi mbuˈti tǝ ɓasinchi, ngga tǝ ndik ɗathla ndu shenuˈtǝɗi nech kaɓ hur inchiyowun wa, paɗ tǝ fǝr kit kǝ alkǝti Shemeti Farta. <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />Kǝthlǝm kǝ chok fǝr kit ˈyowun kǝ mbǝr ǝni nafcha wa, paɗ kǝ chok kǝ ɗar alkǝti Farta.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndik Bulus kǝ ɗar mbǝr ǝni Farta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Nat tǝ kǝɗu thlǝ ndikchi tǝ mbǝr ǝni Farta kǝmɗi fee manchǝ hur shemeta, paɗ ngga mbǝrˈǝni yuwa heshiɗiya wa, ngga weˈtǝ yi fǝ kuturakchi yuwa heshiɗiya fee naa alkǝt ˈyandǝ tǝɓata wa. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Nechamǝn ndiktǝ kǝ ɓǝra mbǝr ǝni Farta thla nech kǝ wubtaˈan, thla tahsandǝ Farta ha tǝn wa heshi wa kǝthlǝm maandi yamǝn. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Yowun hur kuturakchiɗi yuwa heshiɗiya wathlanchi tandǝ ha wa, kǝthlǝm maa tǝ sǝnnda, mǝ kukwawandǝ Chinda thlǝ maanda ha wa. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Ichiɗiya sǝɓchan kǝɗu kǝɗ ǝnɗi yarandǝ fee ha ndat wa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">“Ichiɗi tamwak tǝ weniti nef nata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">Ichiɗi tamwak tǝ thlǝmati nef sǝkta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">Ichiɗi tamwak tǝ wanɗǝkaɗati nefa kaɗatsi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">Fen nech kǝ ichiɗi tahsandǝ Farta ha kǝmɗi fee thlǝ yahchǝ anchi.”<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Nggamǝn pǝnandǝ Farta ǝnɗiya hayang, tǝmɗi Shemetˈyan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 2:10">Shemeta thlǝ kechan ichi nat, nat tǝ ichiɗi nech hwengnga i Farta. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Wun nech mbahǝn sǝn kaɗaɗi hur wanɗǝkaɗati yowun, maangga Shemeti nafan wa? Kǝɗu natǝn paɗ nefsǝ nech mbahǝn sǝn kaɗati Farta wa maangga Shemeti Farta wa. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Nggǝmǝn ngga shemeti heshi mbǝstǝmǝn wa, paɗ Shemet thla ɓech mǝɗi Farta, kǝthlǝm kǝ wathlaminchǝ kǝ ɗar ichiɗi fǝramǝndǝ Farta pafǝn. <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Thleya nech kǝ ichiɗi thlǝ mbuˈtǝmǝn, ngga mbǝr ǝni nef pǝnamǝn cha wa. Thlǝ ndikchamǝn kǝ ɓǝra ǝnɗi mbuˈamǝndǝ Shemeta. Thlǝ tǝɓran chamǝn ǝnɗi mbuˈtǝ Shemet ha kǝmɗi fee nech tǝ Shemet fa. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Naf ɗi nawak tǝ Shemeti Farta fiyan nggen thlǝt ichiɗi ɓech thlǝma Shemeti Farta wa. Kǝthlǝm koha ǝn mǝɗiyan, paɗ nggech sǝn tanda wa, kǝthlǝm Shemeti Farta thlǝ ɗǝfchǝ nef si kǝ sǝna. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Nafɗi nech tǝ Shemeti Farta thlǝ chakchan mee kǝ ɓǝra icha nat. paɗ nafɗi ngga waktǝ Shemet sǝ fiyan nggen mbahǝn chakan mee wa.<verse eid="1CO 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Yaranchi fee ha hur laulawati Farta, ndat wa, “Wun sǝn chǝ kaɗati Chinda Farta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:16">natǝn chaˈan ǝnɗi har natǝn chita?” Nggamǝn Shemeti Farta hurmǝn, paɗ kaɗat ˈyamǝn artǝ tǝ yi Kǝristi.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Chak tǝ ha hur wum indi fǝtǝr mbancha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Wanmanchina, fartǝɗi nati tǝ wunchi, ndikowun wisi kǝɗ fee naa shemeti Farta fiyanda wa. Ndikowun chisi kǝɗ ǝnɗi thlǝ ndikti tǝ nafchiɗi nech hur fata. Nafchiɗi nech kǝ wan waaˈyaarchi hur Kǝristi. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Sǝmowunchi ǝn tǝ yinja, ngga tǝ ɗǝsǝmǝnɗi nech lǝklǝk wa, kǝthlǝm chaˈwowun mǝɗ ka ndǝ ɗǝsǝmǝnɗi nech lǝklǝk wa. Paˈ kǝ nakanya nowun mbahǝn mǝɗ kanchi wa. <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />Kǝthlǝm chika kǝ nakanya pǝˈchowun wiˈtǝ hur fata. Ma tana kun sǝraˈ raˈan, kun yandǝ tǝ raˈan, pǝn wa hach yuwa peˈchowun wiˈtǝ hur fata wa? Thleya pǝn wa wa, thlǝ nechowun thlǝ nandǝ ichǝ kaɗ kǝɗ fee nech hur fata ndak wa? <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Kǝthlǝm ma ndiyowun wa, “Nggǝt yi Bulus,” yowun paɗ wa, “Nggǝt yi Apolos,” awi, pǝn wa wa, nechowun keˈke tǝ takǝɗ nafchi heshiɗiya wa?<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Wun nech kǝ Apolos? Wun nech kǝ Bulus paɗi? Awi ngga mafechǝ Farta ndak wa, fee fǝrtǝ wun kit tǝmɗiyanda. Chikawun hurnanda fǝran Farta ǝnɗi natǝn chita. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Nggǝt chehcha, Apolos pǝnchǝ ˈyaman, paɗ Farta ɗǝfchǝsi kǝ tifa, mangkan. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan ndu thlǝ chehtaˈan, tǝ thlǝ pǝnˈyaman, ngga meˈi ǝn nakanɗa wa, Fartaˈan ndak mǝthlan tǝɗi ɗǝfchǝ ichǝs kǝ tifnda, paɗ mangkan. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Thlǝ chehtaˈan, tǝ thlǝ pǝnˈyaman, kaɗatˈyandǝ kǝ ɓǝra ǝn arta, chikawuni nan mɓǝs kǝnau ter ˈyan. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Kǝthlǝm nggǝmǝn fǝ tarchi Farta fee nech chǝt ter mǝt arta. Kun kǝɗ hǝngngǝ Farta, kǝɗ tǝnndi Farta paɗ.<verse eid="1CO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Tǝmɗi kafaɗi fǝritǝ Farta, ndaˈan ɗǝfti fǝl tǝnan kǝɗ thlǝ mɓǝ r tǝnnda. Yowun paɗ tǝndǝ kǝ ɗaran. Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan, chikawun nech tǝnan kǝ mbǝrsi tǝ weˈtǝ tǝnɗi natǝn chǝt kǝ ɗaran. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Kǝthlǝm yowunsi nech mbahǝn ɗǝf fǝl tǝnan samǝn mǝ thla tapaɗ fee ɗǝfta wa. Fǝl tǝn ini ndaˈan nech kǝ Yesu Kǝristi. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Maa chi yowun tertǝ, ndu tǝ rathlata, ndu tipesha, ndu tǝ ɗakwan pǝlaarcha, ndu tǝ ɗǝfcha, ndu tǝ chilɓǝrcha, ndu tǝ kwafcha, <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />fartǝ chak mee, nwaat nan pǝn weˈtǝ tarɗi chit chikawun thlǝ tǝnnda. Waɗan nan kaɗa ndǝ ndǝɗ tarɗi chit chikawuni. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Ma ǝ hǝraˈ tǝnndi tǝndǝ fee ǝ ɗar fǝl tǝnan ewu wa kaɗ wa, naa thlǝ tǝnan mbǝs kǝnau tǝndǝyan. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Ma ǝ en wat tǝnan kaɗi, chok chan wa thlǝ tǝnan chǝt asar, chika nakan mǝthlan tǝ indiyan nan hǝraˈta, paɗ chok chan kǝɗ hǝraˈchan kesh tǝ hur wata.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Awi, sǝnwowun wa Wiri Farta nakowun wa, paɗ Shemeti Farta nechan ɗas hwǝrˈyowun wa? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Nat thla sǝbanchi wiri Farta ini kaɗi, naa Farta sǝɓandǝ kaɗi. Kǝthlǝm wiri Farta nechan chǝɗchǝɗ, paɗ kun nech kǝ wiri Fartaˈan.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Mǝ lǝmwun indiyowun wa. Ma tǝr yowun indiyan wa thlǝ mbǝrˈin nakan, tǝmɗi mbǝrˈǝni yuwa heshiɗi nakan ya, chok kan kǝɗ ɓema. Kǝthlǝm kǝ mbǝstǝ chokta kǝ thlǝ mbǝrˈǝna. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Kǝthlǝm mbǝrˈini heshiɗiya nechan kǝ ɓamkǝta ǝ pangngǝn Farta. Kǝthlǝm nechan kǝ yaraɗan, ndat wa “Thlǝ kǝsanchan fǝ mbǝrˈicha tǝmɗi ɗathlǝ yanda.” <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Yaranchi fee ha paɗ, hur laulawati Farta, ndat wa “Chinmǝn ǝ shin wa kaɗati fǝ mbǝrˈicha nechan kǝ kohaɗan.” <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan mǝ thlaˈan yowun inda kǝ ɓǝra yowun pangnda wa. Kǝthlǝm chika mǝ nat yuwun, <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />Ndu Bulus, ndu Apolos, ndu Kefas, ndu hurheshi, ndu shishingnda, ndu mǝrta, ndu ichiɗi nakanya, ndu ichiɗi nech ɓat pangnga. Chikamǝ nat yuwun. <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />Kun yi Kǝristi, Kǝristi paɗ yi Farta.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Tatǝ kǝmsichi Kǝristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Tǝ kǝɗu, kǝɗaya nat wun thlǝ tǝr nggaˈan wa fǝ tarchi Kǝristi nakaˈan, thla fǝramǝndǝ fee tera kǝ mbuˈmǝn ichiɗi nech tǝ wuɓtǝ fa i Farta. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Ənɗi yah tǝ fee mǝɗi fee fǝrandǝ fee heˈtǝɗa tanda, kǝ chok ndǝ kǝ fǝ chǝt ter tǝ hwir arta. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Nakanya haɗ wa nenchǝ hur wa ndu kun ndu wur chak mee kǝ ndǝ chi nda wa chinchǝ ɓǝɓifata. Nggǝt tǝ indinchǝ chaka wi mee indinchǝ wa. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Kittaˈan sǝn wi ndu chichǝ ɓǝɓifata wa, kǝɗu paɗ chok wa wa sǝɓawi kaɗ pangngǝn Farta wa. Chinda tǝ indiyan nech ɗǝbandǝ tarɗi chandǝ ndu ndiˈchan ndu ɗǝɗ wa wa. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan, kǝ chakawun mee yowuna wa, ǝ saˈwu fartaˈan kwaɗǝn wa. Na fartǝ chak mee ini ɓata fartǝɗi ɓa Chindǝ Yesu kaɗi. Nan pǝn ɗaˈkǝta kǝ ɓǝra ichiɗi wuɓandǝ wuthlǝ tanda, paɗ kǝ kohtantǝ ichiɗi kesh nech hur wanɗǝkaɗati nafcha. Ə fartǝ ini nan chim chikawuni keˈke tǝ tarɗi thlǝnandǝn.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Wanmanchina hǝssa tǝ nǝssa, kǝ ɗar ndiktǝ ichiɗiya, fǝrchi saktaˈan tǝ indinchi, tǝ paɗ Apolos kǝthlǝm kǝ kǝsowun chǝs kǝ sǝnwun. Kǝthlǝm paɗ kǝ chaˈowun mǝɗiyaˈan saktǝ ndik tǝɗi yarandǝ fee ha ndat wa, “Kǝ chǝ yowun ǝna thla nech mɓǝran ndǝ ǝnɗi yarandǝ fee ha hur Laulawati Farta wa.” Tǝ kǝɗu kǝ thlaˈan yowun inda wa, tǝ ndat wa ɓǝrantǝ yowun ha arta kǝthlǝm thlǝ parechan artǝ hur ǝn wa. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Wun nducha wa pǝɗenin takichaˈan ha? Mǝ paɗ nǝsso, thla ngga Farta furucha wa? Maa pafǝn furutǝ fee, michicha thlǝ natu thlaˈandǝ inda kǝɗ ngga pafǝn mbǝstu wa?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Nakan ya tapi mbǝswun nat ǝnɗi yahtǝwun wa? Tapi chokwun kǝ wurumǝncha wa? Ndu chok wun kǝɗ kuturchi fee nech chǝt kutǝrakta ngga tǝ nggaˈan wa? Maa tǝn kǝ kit, nggak wun chǝt kuturakta, kǝthlǝm nggaˈan paɗ kǝ chǝmǝn kuraktǝ tǝ wunchi. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Maa ǝ natinchi, ɗǝf Farta nggaˈansi, nggaˈan fǝ thlǝncha nggaˈan nech naa kǝrsa ǝ kǝrsǝ nafcha. Kǝɗ fee thle ndǝ fee tandǝ chak mii mǝrta ha pangngǝn chikawuni. Kǝthlǝm nggaˈan chok ǝn kǝ ǝnɗi naa nat heshi, fǝ thlǝncha, tǝ nafcha nat ndǝ ɗǝfan wenitǝ tanda. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Chok ǝn kǝ mɓamcha kǝthlǝm Kǝristi, paɗ kun mɓǝr in ˈyowun si hur Kǝristi. Alkǝt ˈyaˈansi wa, paɗ kun alkǝtˈyowun si. Thlǝ chim chǝ nafchǝ wunchi, paɗ thlǝ njirchǝ fee nggaˈan. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Nakanya, nggaˈan mitǝ fiˈyan tǝ kwichimnda. Pawaˈan kapech ndiˈchan wa. Nafchǝ ɓahaˈanda, tǝ paɗ wurchiyaˈan su wa. <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />Kǝrtǝt ˈyaˈan thlǝ sǝmndǝ ǝn kǝthlǝm thlǝ chi chaˈan ter kaˈan. Maa ˈyari fee nggaˈan kwal kaˈan kaɗ tǝ mbǝs ǝna. Maa tandǝ fǝraˈan ɓahta kǝrǝskaˈan. <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />Maa mbuˈ nafchǝ ǝnɗi nawak chǝ kǝ kit kǝ indi yaˈan, thlǝ nggǝman chaˈan tandǝ tǝ kafata. Paˈ kǝ ɓukuya, chok chamǝn kǝɗ nggǝmǝn nech kǝ chǝrǝfti heshi, ǝnɗi thlǝ naa chika wun wiɗekta.<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Ngga yarechi ǝnɗa kǝthlǝm kǝ ɗǝfiwunchi kǝ har tǝ fata wa. Paɗ kǝthlǝm kǝ tǝɗani thlǝmat ˈyowun kǝthlǝm tǝ nowun kǝ wanchinchi fee yahti. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Chika ndech fee wa, fǝ chaˈanchi ˈyowunsi hur Kǝrǝsti fee thlǝ mbahǝn waktǝ fee shenganda, chinchiwun sǝ terchan wa. Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan chokin chǝ kǝ chinda kǝmɗiyowun hur Kǝrǝsti tǝmɗi ɓowun kwastǝ ndikta yi sǝkta. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan, nggǝt shiyowun nda chaˈam tǝ nenchi. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan nggǝt thlǝnowun Timoti thla nech kǝɗ waˈinchi. Thla yahti kaˈan, thlǝ chich teri Farta tǝ hwir arta. Nan kuɗu kowun natǝnchǝ ha hur Kǝristi Yesu. Natinchi ha thla thlǝ pǝɗech keˈke tǝ ǝnɗi thlǝ chaˈandi kaɗi chǝk ǝ ayi ǝ chika yen mǝt nggomndi fǝ fǝr kit cha.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Fowun nafchǝ hur wun thlaˈ inda tǝr chanda wa nggǝ ɓǝ kǝmɗiyowun wa wa? <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Paɗ maa nggǝman Farta nii ɓat kǝmɗiyowun tolla wa. Kǝ ɗǝbani paɗ weˈti alkǝt mǝ nessi fǝ thlaˈ inchi ɗa, ngga ndikchiyanda ndak wa. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Kǝthlǝm ndik kutǝrakti Farta ngga ndiktǝ ǝ me wa, ndikta yi alkǝta. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Mǝtatǝwun har, kǝ ɓi kǝmɗiyowun tǝ teta wa, ndu hur yah raˈan tǝ hashas tǝ wandǝkaɗata wa?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Ndik fǝllaukǝta hur nafchi Farta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Sǝkin chǝwa ndik tǝ fǝlaukit nech wiˈtǝ kaɗ ǝ hurwun. Wiˈtǝ fǝlaukǝɗ ɗi chǝka fee thlǝ fǝr wakchi kit chiwa nda wa. Mbuˈi chǝ fee tǝ ndat wa, yowun sǝ hurwun thlǝ hunechan tǝ nu chinan. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Maa thlǝ sǝɓ chi ichiɗa pǝthlǝr wun, mǝ chich thlǝ natwun thlaˈandǝ inda? Kǝmchansi kǝ nowun tǝta, kǝthlǝm ɓǝɓife ini. Rǝkam weˈtǝ nef ini kesh pǝthlǝr wun.<verse eid="1CO 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Chika mǝ nakan wa nggǝt tǝ wunchi wenitǝ tǝ wenita wa, nggǝt tǝ wunchi hur Shemeta. Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan tapi chakani mee nef ini hur thlǝm Chinda Yesu kǝɗ thla mǝ nati chanda maa tǝni thlǝmat wun. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Cham ǝnɗi nati mbuˈowun nda. Nat fartǝɗi wumnduwun ha, nggǝt paɗ nggǝt tǝ wunchi hur shemeta, tǝ alkǝti Farta Chinda Yesu minni. <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />Fǝr kowun weˈtǝ nef ini kǝmɗi hweˈra, kǝthlǝm kǝ ɓǝlantǝ fat ˈyan, paɗ kǝ hǝraˈan fee shishing ndiyan fartǝ ɓati Chinda Yesu kaɗi.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Wilwir tǝɗi thlǝ natwun chita ngga ǝn ndiˈchan wa. Awi, sǝnwowun wa, wan yisti ngguɗyeh thlǝ hupanchi fuhwa njohǝma wa? <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan mǝkaman ɗohtǝ yisti kaɗi, kǝthlǝm kǝ chok wun kǝ yuwa fuhwa njohǝma thla nawak tǝ yisti fiyan. kittaˈan wa tapi chakowun chǝ fee ha tǝ yisti. Kǝthlǝm tapi thlen fee Kǝristi wan chohrat ˈyamǝn yi mbǝnfa tathla. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan, kuɗu kam tǝ mɓǝnfata, ngga tǝ johumɗi naa ɗohtǝ yisti fiyan, ndat wa, ɓǝɓifata tǝ wenikǝta. Paɗ tǝ johumɗi nawaktǝ yisti si fiyan. Johuman nech kǝ thlǝrɗaktǝ tǝ raˈan tǝ paɗ chǝt kit.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Yarowun chisi hur ɗelwer taˈan ndat wa, kǝ wumawun indǝ tǝ fǝ chǝt fǝlaukǝta wa. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Ngga nechi kaɗata wa fee naa fǝlau kǝt ˈyan ndǝs hur heshiɗiya wa, ndu fǝ yah icha, ndu fǝ yar kicha, ndu fǝ ɗǝhacha. Kǝthlǝm maa ndaˈan nech kǝ kaɗatinchi nwaat kǝ malwun heshiɗiya ha. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Paɗ nggǝt yarowun ndǝs wa, mǝ wumawun inda tǝ nafɗi tǝrchi indiyan wa thlǝ fǝr kit nakan wa, paɗ fǝlau nakan. Ndu thlǝ yah icha, ndu thlǝ ɗǝhacha, ndu thlǝ sǝɓandǝ thlǝm nafchǝ kaɗi, ndu thlǝ sabala, ndu thlǝ lǝm nafcha kǝ harantǝ ichiyanda, chika ɗǝsǝmnda mǝ sǝmwun tǝ weˈtǝ nef ini wa.<verse eid="1CO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Ngga terinchi wa kǝ chakani mee fee nawakchǝ kǝ fǝ fǝr kit cha, Ngga fee fǝr chǝ kit nat wun chakan mee tanda wa? <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Farta thlǝ chakan chǝ mee fee nawakchǝ kǝ fǝ fǝr kit cha. Kǝtaman thlǝ wenikǝt inni kesh ǝ hurwun.<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s">Ɗǝt tǝ raˈan kǝ mǝt chak mee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Maa yowunsi naa ɓilla ˈyansi kǝ ɓǝra sheɗan pǝthlǝr wun, kǝthlǝm mǝ natǝn ɗǝt tǝ ɓilla ˈyan kǝmɗi fee thlǝ parawak chǝ Farta? Michicha nawak tǝn ɗǝt taˈanchi kǝmɗi nafchi Farta? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Awi, sǝnwowun wa nafchi Farta nech chakan mee heshiɗiya wa? Maa nowun ɗǝt chakan mee heshiɗiya, nowun mbahǝn chak mee kǝ ɓǝra wan wan ɓilla cha kǝɗ thleya wa? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Sǝnwowun wa namǝn chakan mee fǝ thlǝn cha wa? Maa nan chok tǝ kǝɗu, chak mee kǝ ɓǝra ichiɗi heshiɗiya nech wulamǝn ndǝ hacha wa? <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan, maa ɓilla ˈyowunsi kǝ ɓǝra weˈtǝ ichiɗi kǝ ɗaya, michicha thlǝ nat wun kata fee naa natˈyandǝ ha kǝmwa su wa pangngǝn fǝ para Farta, kǝ chakowun chǝ ndǝ mee? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Mbuˈ chi kǝɗu kǝthlǝm kǝ harowunchǝ fata. Awi, ka nggǝ yowun nefsǝ thlǝ mbǝr ǝna arta ǝ hurwun, thla nech mbahǝn chak mee pǝthlǝr fǝ fǝr kit chǝ chap wa? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Kǝm waasi thla nech hur Kǝristi kǝ ɗǝ mǝk wan har sheɗan ǝ pangngǝn fee thlǝ fǝr wakchi kit, kǝthlǝm chak mee wa?<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Nakan nggun mǝk wanhar raˈan, pinchan su wa tǝ wulowun chi fata yi kit. Ngga mǝ kwechan kǝ kǝrǝswun kǝ ɗathlowunchi ndǝ fa wa? Paɗ kǝ kǝrǝswun kǝ ˈyatowun chindǝ ǝnɗi nǝch kǝ yuwun wa? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Nat tǝ kǝɗu, nakowun ɗathla, nggun chǝt ǝnɗi kǝmwak chǝsi kǝmɗi fowun nafcha. Thlǝ chichowun ichiɗa maa kǝmɗi fee nech kǝ wanmanchǝwun hur Kǝristi.<verse eid="1CO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Awi, ǝ sǝnwowun wa, fǝ kumi kakicha nandǝ chok kǝrsǝ mǝrti kutǝrak tǝ Farta wa? Mǝ lǝm fee wunchǝ wa. Nggǝ fǝlauchǝs wa, ndu fǝ chit tar ɗǝhacha, ndu fǝ kaa nǝssi fowuna, ndu hǝssa fǝ hunnat tǝ hǝssa. <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />Ndu yarcha, ndu fǝ yahˈicha, ndu fǝ saaˈicha, ndu fǝ sǝɓandǝ thlǝm nafchi kaɗi, ndu fǝ thlǝm nafcha kǝ thlǝnandǝ ichiyanda, nech yimndǝ kǝ kuturakti Farta wa. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Fowun hurwun nechandǝ kǝɗu choh. Nakanya, chapowun chi fee kaɗi. Hǝlengngowun chi Farta kaɗi, chokowun kan kǝ fee nawak tǝ ɓǝɓifech ˈyandǝs pangngǝn nan, hur thlǝm Chinda Yesu Kǝristi tǝ Shemetˈyan.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manaman Farta tǝ fatˈyowun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />Naa yowun mbahǝn ndata wa, “Mbandǝn chǝs kǝ chi ǝnɗi yahti.” Aa, paɗ ngga chika mǝ nech chǝt ter kǝmɗiyo wa. Nii mbahǝn ndata wa, “Alkǝtǝn chǝs kǝ chi chika mǝ nat ǝnɗi yahti.” Paɗ nii nggǝmachi kǝ chi ǝn kuturakta tǝ nenchi wa. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Naa yowun nef mbahǝn ndata wa, “Chich fee ɗǝsǝmnda kǝthlǝm hwira, hwira kǝthlǝm ɗǝsǝmnda.” Thleya kit, paɗ Farta nan ɓǝlandat kat nat chap. Ngga kǝthlǝm fǝlaukǝt chǝt fee fata wa, chich fee kǝthlǝm manandǝ Chinmǝn Yesu, Chinmǝn Yesu paɗ kǝ fǝrtǝ shishingnda kǝ faɗan. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Farta thlaˈanchi Chinda ǝ mǝmatecha, nggǝmǝn paɗ nechan thlaˈamǝnda hur mǝmatecha tǝmɗi alkǝtˈyan.<verse eid="1CO 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Awi, sinwowunwa tanggathla fechyowun yi Kǝristi wa wa? Ni tǝr tanggathla fati Kǝristi kǝ wumaniha tǝ fati nunefa thla nech kǝ fǝlau wa? Nech tam cha wa. <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Awi, sinwowunwawa, nat thla wumanchi fat tǝ fǝlau, chok ndǝ kǝ fat arta tǝ mǝthlan wa? Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan nechan kǝ yaraɗan hur Laulawati Farta, ndat wa, “nat ndǝ chap nandǝ choktǝ kǝ fat arta.” <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Paɗ nat thla wumanchǝ inda tǝ Chinda, chok chan wa nechandǝ arta tǝ mǝthlan hur Shemeta.<verse eid="1CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Mbǝham langnga tǝ fǝlaukǝta. Nat takǝɗ ɓǝɓifaɗi naa nef chita ngga fat ˈyan natǝn cha nda wa, paɗ ɓǝɓifa fǝlaukǝta kǝ fat ˈyan natǝn chǝt ɓǝɓifata. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Awi, sǝnwowun wa fat ˈyowun Wiri Shemeti Farta wa, thla nech ɗas hurwun, thla fǝrowun ndǝ Farta wa? Ngga kun nech tǝ alkǝt indǝyowun wa. <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />Tǝ hǝyowun chǝ Farta tǝ feri Yesu Kǝristi. Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan manaman Farta tǝ fechˈyowun.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s">Nggǝman Bulus chiha micha kǝ ɓǝra reta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Nakanya kǝ ɓǝra chihamichiɗi yaritǝwunsi. Ndiˈchan si hishnefa kǝ mǝntǝ nunefa wa. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Paɗ kǝthlǝm rakandǝ fǝlaukǝt har, kǝmsi chika wun hishnefa kǝn tǝ nuwan, chika wun nunef paɗ tǝ chimaɗan. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Hishnefa kǝ ndiiɗan tǝ ter ˈyan ha yi reta kǝmɗi nuwan, kǝɗu paɗ nunafan kǝmɗi chimaɗan. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Nunafan alkǝtˈyansi kǝ ɓǝra fatˈyan wa, chimaɗan naa alkǝtˈyansi kǝ ɓǝrataˈan. Kǝɗu paɗ hǝsnafan alkǝtˈyansi kǝ ɓǝra fatˈyan wa, nuwan naa alkǝtˈyansi kǝ ɓǝrataˈan. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan kǝ ˈyatawun raˈan fat ˈyowun wa, maa ngga tǝ nggǝmawun kǝ wan shengngǝn chaˈan ngguɗyeh kǝthlǝm kǝ shiwun wa, kǝnowun nggǝr kǝmnda. Kǝthlǝm kǝ lǝm Hwerǝ wunchǝ kǝ chǝwun ɓǝɓifata wa, tǝmɗi kumi kǝrǝs yowun wa. <verse eid="1CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Mbuˈchi thleya kǝ sakawun ha, ngga kusiˈ wa. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Yahtinchi kǝn chika wuni kǝɗ nggǝta, kǝn wakchǝ reta. Paɗ nakan chikawuni tǝ weˈtǝ mbǝrˈǝniɗi fǝrandǝ Farta. Yowun weˈtǝ mbǝrˈǝniɗa, yowun paɗ weˈtǝ thleyu.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Kǝ ɗar fee kǝn wakchǝ reta, tǝ fee mǝrtǝ hǝssǝ yanda, thlǝ ɗǝbanchi nan nat ndiˈchan kǝ chok ndǝ ha kǝn wa ndǝ reta wa, kǝɗ nggǝta. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Paɗ maa ngga ndǝ mbahǝn kǝrǝs wa, tǝr kandǝ nunefa. Ai kwech chan kǝ tǝr ndǝ nunefa, mǝni kǝ san yah mǝndǝ tǝ raˈan, hur inchiyanda.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Nakanya kusiˈ nati fǝrandǝ fee tapech kǝ kǝndǝ reta. Kusiˈ tǝɗa ngga yina wa, yi Chinda Yesu tǝ indiyan. Ndat wa, nunefa kǝ chakndǝ ha tǝ chǝmaɗan wa. <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />Paɗ maa chek ha tǝ chǝmaɗan, kǝ chok ha, kǝ kǝntǝ reta wa. Maa yahtǝ reta, kǝ nggǝranchiˈin kǝmɗi chimaɗan kǝ tahsandǝ kaɗi. Hishnef paɗ kǝ chak ha tǝ nuwan wa.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Kǝ ɗar takichaˈan paɗ, nggǝt mbuˈcha, ngga Chinda Yesu wa. Maa yowun wan mandǝsi thla naa nuwan si fǝr wakchǝ kit, nggǝman kǝ nuɗi kǝ choknda, kǝɗu, kǝ chakha tǝ ndǝ wa. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Maa yowun nunǝfsi thla naa chimaɗan si, thla naa wak tǝ kit ˈyansi, nggǝm kanfa kǝ chokndǝ rǝmma, kǝɗu, nunafan kǝ chakha tǝ ndǝ wa. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Kǝthlǝm hǝsnafɗi thlǝ fǝr wak chǝ kit, nechan chǝɗchǝɗ tǝmɗi chok tiyan arta tǝ nuwan. Kǝɗu paɗ, nuɗi nawaktǝ fǝr kit ˈyansi, nechan chǝɗchǝɗ tǝmɗi chok tiyan arta tǝ chǝmaɗan. Maa ngga kǝɗu wa, wan chanda nechandǝ choktǝ kǝ tǝkǝmǝnchaˈan, paɗ kittaˈan, tandǝ fǝ chǝɗchǝɗ cha.<verse eid="1CO 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Ndu hǝs nafan, ndu nunafan thla thlǝ fǝr wakchǝ kit yehsi kǝ chakndǝ ha, kǝɗu, chak kandǝ ha. Ə minni wan mana kǝ hishnefa ndu nunefa hur fǝr kit, chok wa kǝ nwaat ɗar nanda wa, kǝthlǝm ˈyech Farta nggamǝn kǝ chok has has kǝta. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Chǝ nunǝfa, sǝnwen wa, ndu tǝmɗiyo naa chimatwu mbǝs hǝraˈta wa? Chǝ hishnefa, sǝnwen wa, ndu tǝmɗiyo naa nuwu mbǝs hǝraˈta wa?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Weˈtǝ chok tǝɗi yahtǝ Farta kǝ chǝfee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Chika wuni kǝn natˈyan ha kǝɗ thla tahsandǝ Chindǝ si. Naɗi ha ˈya Farta ndi kǝthlǝm ndaˈan. Kusiˈ tǝɗi nati fǝrandǝ nat nafcha fǝ fǝr kit chǝ hacha. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Nat thla ˈya Farta ndi, thla naa hechet ˈyansi choh, kǝ ka choktǝ ha yi kumi hechata wa. Nat thla ˈya Farta ndi, thla nawaktǝ hechetˈyansi choh, kǝ ndawa nwaat kǝ hechan fee wa. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Hecheta ndu kumi hecheta, ngga ǝnawa, paɗ fǝr maanda kǝ kusiˈ chi Farta, ndaˈan yahtǝ Farta. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Chika wuni kǝ chok kǝɗ ǝnɗi natǝn fartǝɗi ˈya Farta anchi. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Maa mafat nako fartǝ ɗi ˈya fee wechi, kǝ ɓillen wa. Maa ǝnsi natu mbahǝn chǝt kǝ chenkesh hur maafakitˈyo, chiko. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Nat thla nech kǝ mafata fartǝɗi ˈya Farta anchi kǝ chok kǝ thlǝ para Kǝristi, ngga mafat nakan paɗ wa. Kǝthlǝm wumamtǝ indǝ tǝ Yesu Kǝristi. Kǝɗu paɗ, thla nawakchǝ kǝ mafata, fartǝɗi ˈya Farta ndi, chok kǝ mafati Kǝristi. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Hichǝ Farta wunchi tǝ ǝn ndiˈchan, kǝ nggǝmwunfa kǝ chokwun kǝ mafeechi nafcha wa. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Wan manchina, nat ǝnɗi naa nef huran, fartǝɗi ˈya fee anchi, chokkan huran kǝɗu tǝ Farta.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kǝ ɓǝra nǝssiɗi nawaktǝ ret ˈyandǝsi, tǝ fee mǝrtǝ hǝssiyanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Kǝ ɓǝra nǝssiɗi nawaktǝ ret ˈyandǝsi kwaɗǝn, fǝri wu Chinda kusiˈ kǝ ɓǝra tǝ nanda wa. Paɗ nggǝt mbuˈ ǝnɗi nech wanɗǝkaɗatinchi ndat wa, nggǝt thlǝ fǝr kit, tǝmɗi kafati Farta. <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Ninchi ha ndiˈchan, kǝmsi kǝ chok nef kǝɗ ǝnɗi natin, kǝthlǝm ɓahtǝɗi ha natmǝn huran nakanya. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Maa nuwusi, kǝ kelǝn nuwu ha wa. Maa tapawa kehwen nunefa wa, mǝ ndenwa no kah nunefa wa. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Paɗ maa kehǝn nunefa, chiwen ɓǝɓifata wa. Nuɗi nawaktǝ retˈyansi kwaɗǝn, maa kahan fee, chǝwa ɓǝɓifata wa. Yahchisi kǝ sǝnwun, fee kahchi kaana nandǝ sa ɓahta hur nat ˈyandǝ ha. Ndaˈan chich, yahtisi kǝ yipowunchi ǝ ɓahtǝɗi haya.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Wanmanchina, ǝnɗi nati mbuˈta ndaˈan nech kǝ, wanmǝnchiɗi tahsandǝ Farta ha ɗuk tǝɓata. Thlaˈtǝ nakanya, fee naa nǝssa ndǝsi kǝ chok nda kǝɗ nǝssa ndǝs wa. <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />Fee nech tǝta, kǝ chokndǝ kǝɗ ngga tǝnandǝ tǝtawa. Fee nech hur sǝk mbǝnchifa, kǝ chok nda kǝɗ nafchiɗi nawakchi hur sǝk mbǝndǝ fa. Fǝ hiˈicha paɗ, kǝ chok ndǝ kǝɗ ǝn ˈyandǝs wa. <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />Fee nech chit ter tǝ ǝna heshiɗiya, kǝ malandǝ ǝna heshiɗiya, kǝ tǝrantǝ hur indiyanda wa. Kǝthlǝm heshiɗiya kǝɗ ǝnɗi natǝn nakanya, mǝthlan mbǝrtǝ ha.<verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Yah wisi kǝ nowun hur ɓilla wa. Thla kahwakchi nunefa thlǝ ɓillechan tǝ tarchi Chinda kaˈan, kǝɗ thla natǝn tǝrandǝ hwiri Chindǝ ha. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Thla kahchi nunefa, thlǝ ɓillechan tǝ ina heshi, kǝɗ thla natǝn tǝrandǝ hwiri nuwan ha. <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />Chak hur indiyan ha chap hacha. Nuɗi nawaktǝ chimaɗan si, ndu wannuwaa, thlǝ ɓillechan tǝ tarchi Chinda kaˈan, natǝn chok tǝ chǝɗchǝɗ hur fata tǝ shemeta. Nuɗi naa chimaɗan sǝ paɗ, thlǝ ɓillechan tǝ ichi heshi, kǝɗ thla natǝn tǝrandǝ hwiri chimaɗan ha. <verse eid="1CO 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Mbuˈchi kǝɗu kǝthlǝm kǝ kǝsowun chisi, ngga kǝ ɗǝfiwunchis nwaat tǝ yowun kusiˈ wa. Yahchi kǝ chǝfee chikami hur mbanɗi kǝmchisi. Yahchi kǝ ɗǝfiwunchǝs, kǝ ɗǝfwun wanɗikaɗatˈyowun nat kǝ Chinda Yesu ngga tǝ chakandǝ hur inchiyowun ha wa.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Paɗ kǝ ndǝ fee wa nefa ɗǝf tǝ mee tǝ yowun nunefa thla chaˈchǝs kǝ kahan fee, maa sǝn wa saktiyan kǝmɗi wannuwanɗi natǝn kahta keˈke wa. Maa thlǝ kǝsanchǝ yah hunandǝ kaˈan, chikan ǝnɗi yahtǝ wanɗǝkaɗatˈyan, kǝ kahanchi. Kahanan, ngga ɓǝɓifata wa. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Paɗ nafɗi thlarchiha kǝ ɓǝra ǝnɗi yahtǝ wanɗǝkaɗatˈyan kaˈan, ǝnaɗan ngga nwaat kǝmɗiyan wa, thlǝ mbahǝnchan kǝrista, kǝ tǝr ǝ wanɗǝkaɗatˈyan wa nen kahanchi wannuwananˈyan wa. Mǝthlan paɗ, chǝ keˈke. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan thla kahanchi wannuwanɗi ɗǝftǝn miyan, chit ǝnɗi kǝmchisi. Mǝthlan tǝɗi kahawakchǝ paɗ pǝɗanchi ha. <verse eid="1CO 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Nunefa nen chak ha tǝ chimaɗan wa maa peˈha tǝ shishingnda, paɗ maa ǝ mǝri, nan mbahǝn kah thla yahtǝ wanɗǝkaɗatˈyan, paɗ kǝn kǝ thlǝ para Chinda. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Paɗ ǝ saktinchi, nan sǝk mbǝndǝfa maa nggǝrwa kahtǝ kan wa. Fǝrinchi kit si nggǝt maa Shemeti Fartinchisi.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Kǝɗar ɗǝsǝmǝnɗi fǝrandǝ fee ɗǝhacha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Nakanya kǝɗar ɗǝsǝmǝnɗi fǝrandǝ fee ɗǝhacha, kǝɗ ǝnɗi thlǝ mbuˈtǝ fee, sǝnmǝn wa, “Natmǝnya hurˈinchiyamǝnsi.” Hurˈinda thlǝ ɗǝfchan nefa kǝ maan inda, paɗ mbǝnfata tǝthl tǝnanchi nafcha. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Nat thla thlǝ kaɗechwa kǝdenwa sǝntǝ ǝna, kǝɗu, paˈ kǝ nakanya sǝn wa ǝnɗi kǝmchisi kǝ sǝn wa. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Paɗ nat thla thlǝ yahchǝ Farta, sǝn Farta anchi.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Tǝkǝɗu, kǝɗar sǝm ɗǝsǝmǝnɗi fǝrandǝ fee ɗǝhachǝ paɗ, sǝnmǝnsi ndat wa, “Nat heshiɗiya, ɗǝhata ngga mee i ǝn nakan wa, tǝ ndat paɗ wa, Farta arta, yowunsi wa, mǝthlan ndak.” <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Chika nakan wa, fowunsi thlǝ ˈya fee wa farcha ǝ hur heshi tǝ hulafǝrta, kǝthlǝm “farchǝs” terchan tǝ “chincha” terchan. <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />Nat tǝkǝɗu, kǝmɗiyamǝn, Farta arta, mǝthlan nech kǝ Chinda. Mǝthlan chich ichǝ nat. Thla naa natˈyamǝn ha kǝthlǝm mǝthlan. Chindǝ paɗ arta, Yesu Kǝristi, thla ɓa ichi nat mǝɗiyan. Nggǝmǝn paɗ tǝmɗiyan natmǝn ha.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Paɗ ngga chikawun naa hurˈinɗiyansiya wa. Nakan paˈ kǝ nakanya, fowunsi sǝnchi ha tǝ manandǝ ɗǝhacha, thlǝ tǝrchanda wa ɗǝsǝmǝnɗi thlǝ sǝm ndǝ nda fǝran fee ɗǝhacha. Kǝthlǝm kaɗatyandǝ alkǝtsǝ kwaɗǝnwa, thlǝ tǝrcha nda wa ǝ tǝkǝmndǝ kaɗi.<verse eid="1CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Ɗǝsǝmnda nen ɓǝtǝmǝnchi nduk tǝ Farta wa. Maa sǝmwamǝn wa, kuɓawamǝn ǝna wa, paɗ maa sǝmmǝn, nen chekamǝnchi ǝna wa.<verse eid="1CO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Paɗ kǝ mbǝrwunsi, kǝthlǝm mbǝs har chǝt ǝnɗi nat yahtǝwun, kǝ ɗǝftǝwunchi kǝ chokwun kǝ ɗakwan chewansarti fee nawaktǝ alkǝt ˈyandǝs wa. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Kǝthlǝm maa nii yowun wechi, chi ɗi sǝncha, chi sǝm ɗǝsǝmnda kǝtǝn ɗǝhacha, awi, nen ɗǝf anchi, mǝthlan tǝɗi nawaktǝ shemetˈyan kwaˈkwa, kǝ sǝm tǝ ɗǝsǝmǝnɗi fǝrandǝ fee ɗǝhacha wa? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Tǝ kǝɗu tǝmɗi sǝn ǝnˈyo, nan choktǝ kǝ hǝmndǝ wanmu ha, thla nawaktǝ shemetˈyan kwaˈkwa. Thla mǝrtǝ Kǝristi kǝthlǝm mǝthlan. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Maa chawun wanmanchuwun ɓǝɓifat tǝ mbanɗiya, thlǝ ɗǝfchowun wanmanchuwun fee nawaktǝ shemetˈyandǝ kwaˈkwa, kǝ chǝndǝ ɓǝɓifata. Tǝ kǝɗu, thlǝ chandǝ wun ɓǝɓifat Kǝristi hacha. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan, maa sǝm ɗǝsǝmnda thlǝ ɗǝfchan wanmaana kǝ che wansarta, nii tam kang thliu paɗ wa, kǝthlǝm kǝ ɗǝfi wanmaana kǝ che wansarta wa.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Ənɗi kǝmchǝs kǝ chan fee tatǝ Kǝmsha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Nggǝt mafata wa? Nggǝt ngga tatǝ kǝmsha i Yesu naki wa? Nawi Yesu Chinmǝn tǝ wenitinchi wa? Kun ngga kǝnau terinchi hur Chinda wa? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Kǝmɗi fowuna, maangga tatǝ kimsha naki wa, kittaˈan kǝmɗiyowun tatǝ kǝmsha naki. Kǝthlǝm kun chokchǝ kǝ ǝnɗi nech pǝnda wa tatǝ kimsha naki pangngǝn Chinda.<verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Tǝ thlǝya thlǝ nati kǝsaandǝ indinchisi, kǝmɗi fee thlǝ yahchi kǝ chaki chindǝ mee. <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Awi Barnabas tǝ nggǝta Bulus kǝmwasi kǝ fǝraˈanchi fee ɗǝsǝmnda tǝ ina sata wa? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Mbandiyaˈansi kǝ kahˈǝn nǝssiɗi fǝ fǝr kitcha, kǝ wiˈǝn tǝ tanda wa, kǝɗ thla thlǝ chǝt takǝɗ tatǝ kǝmsicha, tǝ wanmanchi Chinda, tǝ paɗ thlǝ chǝt ndǝ Kefas wa? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Ndu nggǝta Bulus tǝ Barnabas ndak chokchan nwaat kǝ chǝˈǝn tar sǝman ǝn indiyaˈan wa?<verse eid="1CO 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Wun nech chit teri thlǝ kǝnhwira kǝ sǝmantǝ ǝn indiyan? Wun nech huɗa hǝnggǝ yangngga kǝ wulan sǝm wanchaˈan? Wun nech para chapa, kǝ wulan saa yinjaˈan? <verse eid="1CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Mbuˈchi kǝɗu kǝthlǝm kǝt kaɗati nefa wa? Ngga kussiˈ i Musa mbuˈchan kǝɗu paɗ wa? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Kǝthlǝm nechan kǝ yaraɗan hur kussiˈ i Musa ndat wa, “Mǝ nggǝlan fee mee i thla huɗata tǝ langteya ǝ fartǝɗi natǝn chit tar tǝp ɗǝsǝmnda wa.” Thlechi ndak naa Farta ɓillat tǝ tanda wa? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Ngga kǝthlǝm kǝt nggǝmǝn natǝn shenuˈta wa? Kittaˈan kǝthlǝm kǝt nggǝmǝn yara fee. Kǝmchansi thlǝ huɗata tǝ thlǝ tǝptaˈan kǝ ɗǝf ndǝ wanɗǝkaɗatˈyanda ndat wa, nandǝ mbǝs kǝnau ɗǝsǝmǝn hǝngngi ˈyan. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Nakan tapi hǝf ǝn weˈta yi shishingnda kǝ wanɗǝkaɗatˈyowun, chokchan kǝ ǝn ˈyangˈyang mǝɗˈyowun wa, kǝ mbǝs ǝn ɗǝsǝmnda mǝɗˈyowun? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Maa naa fowun mbǝs mban ti ɓillachanda mǝɗˈyowun, awi, pǝɗawaˈan tandǝ ha tǝ mbǝs mban ti ɓillachaˈan mǝɗˈyowun wa?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Nat tǝ kǝɗu chiwaˈan tertǝ mban chǝt kǝɗu wa. Paɗ kǝrisˈǝn tǝ chika mii, kǝthlǝm kǝ ˈyataˈan tar kusheˈtǝ kwastǝ ndikta yi sǝkta i Kǝristi. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Awi sǝnwowun wa fee thlǝ chǝt ter ǝ kǝtǝn shita ǝ minni thlǝ mbǝstǝndǝ ɗǝsǝmndiyanda wa? Fee thlǝ chǝt ter mǝt thle ɓǝra icha, ǝ minni thlǝ mbǝstǝndǝ ɗǝsǝmnda. <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Kǝɗu natǝn paɗ, mbuˈchi Chinda Yesu tǝ ndat wa, fǝ wiˈta kǝnandǝ ɓas kusheˈtiyan thla mbinchan yi sǝkta, tǝmɗi ɓas kusheˈtiˈini nandǝ mbǝs ɗǝsǝmnda.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Paɗ chiwi ter tǝ chǝk arta ǝ hur mbǝs ichiˈinni wa. Paɗ ngga tǝ ni yarowun ndǝs tǝ ɗǝf wanɗǝkaɗatsi kǝthlǝm kǝ chichi fee kǝɗu wa. Mǝ kwech chan mǝrti, mǝ kǝ nggǝmanni kǝ ˈyatichi yowun sǝnda. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Chika nakan wa nggǝt ɓas kwastǝ kusheˈtǝ ndikta, thleya chokwa kǝ ina sǝndǝ kǝmɗinchi wa. Nakan kǝthlǝm kǝt tarɗa ɗǝftǝ fee nenchisi. Aiˈinchi paɗ maa ɓaswi kwastǝ ndikta yi sǝkta wa. <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Maa nechi ɓasa kǝthlǝm kǝt yah indinchi, naa fee fǝri kǝnawan. Paɗ nakan ngga kǝthlǝm kǝt yah indinchi nati ɓasa wa, tǝ fǝrichi fee ǝn kǝ har, kǝ chi. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan, mǝnech kǝ kǝnawan inchi? Kǝnawan inchi, kǝ ɓasi kusheˈtǝ kwastǝ ndikta, kǝ chi pafǝn. Tǝ kǝɗu, chiwi ter paɗ tǝ ndiid mbǝs indinchi yi thlǝ ɓas kwastǝ kusheˈtǝ ndikta yi sǝkta wa.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Chǝk nakan ngga mafati chikawun naki wa, ngga nechi kanɗukwati yowun wa, chani indinchi kǝ mafati chika wuni. Kǝthlǝm kǝ kaɓi nafchi terchan kǝ fǝr ndǝ kit kǝ Chinmǝn Yesu Kǝristi. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Maa nggǝt mǝɗi Yahudawecha, thlǝ chokchi kǝɗ thlǝ Yahudawata, kǝthlǝm kǝ kaɓi Yahudawecha kǝ chok ndǝ kǝ yi Kǝristi. Mǝɗi fee naa kussiˈ i Musa chit kutǝrakta kǝ ɗar nanda, thlǝ chokchi kǝɗ thla naa kussiˈ i Musa chǝt kutǝrakta ǝ ɗaran. Chik nakan wa nggǝtya, ngga kussiˈ taˈan nech chit kutǝrakta ǝ ɗar indinchi wa. Thlǝ chichi kǝɗu, kǝthlǝm kǝ kaɓi fee naa kussiˈ taˈan chit ter kǝ ɗar nanda, kǝmɗi Chinda Yesu. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Kǝmɗi fee nawaktǝ kussiˈ i Musa ɗar nanda, chokkinchi kǝɗ thla nawaktǝ kussiˈ i Musa ɗar indiyan (ngga tǝni ndat wa, kussiˈ i Fartǝs nech chit kurakta ǝ indinchi wa). Auwa, kussiˈ i Kǝristi mǝthlan chit kurakta ǝ ɗar indinchi, kǝthlǝm kǝ kaɓi fee nawakchi ǝ kan kussiˈ i Musa. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Mǝɗi fǝ kumi alkicha hur fǝr kit, chokinchi nggǝ Alkǝtinchǝs wa, kǝthlǝm kǝ kaɓi fee nawaktǝ alkǝtˈyandǝsi kǝmɗi Chinda Yesu Kǝristi. Chokinchi kǝ weˈti chika mii mǝɗi chikawun weˈti nefa kǝthlǝm chika kǝni kǝ hǝraˈani fowuna. <verse eid="1CO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Thlǝ chichi ichiɗiya nat, kǝthlǝm kusheˈti kwasti ndikta thla nech mbinchan yi sǝkta. Kǝ sǝkki mbǝn kǝnau pafǝn i kusheˈti kwasti ndikta thla nech mbinchan yi sǝkta, tǝ takǝɗ nafcha.<verse eid="1CO 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Awi, sǝnwowun wa, ǝ mǝt tarak rakata, nat fǝ rakecha thlǝ rakechanda, paɗ arta ndak thlǝ mbǝschi ǝnɗi tahsandǝ fee tandǝ ha? Kǝɗu, nakowun kweˈtǝha tǝ rakata kǝthlǝm kǝ mbǝswun ǝnɗi tahsandǝ fee ha. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Chikawun thlǝ rakata thlǝ eltanchan indiyan kaˈan ǝ hur chikayen mbenna. Thlǝ chichandǝ kǝɗu kǝthlǝm kǝ mbǝsndǝ fatǝ inɗi thlǝ sǝɓchi kaɗi. Nggaˈan paɗ fatǝ indiyaˈan ngga thla thlǝ sǝɓchi kaɗ wa. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan rakatinchi ngga wa mǝtsi nati saˈta wa. Yandinchi paɗ ngga rinna thlǝ nati thlǝfta wa. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Paɗ thlǝ eltanchi fatinchi kǝ nggǝranni kaɗ kǝ mafatinchi, kǝthlǝm kǝrsi ɓasinchi kǝmɗi fowun, nggǝt tǝ indinchi kǝ ˈyatichifee mbǝs ǝnɗi tahsandǝ fee ha wa.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Chaˈata hur nati Israˈilawecha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Wanmanchina hǝssǝ tǝ nǝssa, yahchisi kǝ sǝnwun, ndat wa, kakechimǝn nat wiˈchandǝ ǝ kan husaba, nat ndǝ paɗ mbǝrchandǝ ha tǝ hur kufa. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Tǝmɗi mbǝrtiyandǝ ha ǝ hur husabiˈyan, tǝ hur kufiˈyan paɗ, chokkan kǝɗ tǝ chan fee tandǝ baptisma, chokkandǝ kǝ fǝ para Musa. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Nat nda sǝm kandǝ weˈtǝ ɗǝsǝmndǝ arta, yi shemeta. <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />Nat ndǝ paɗ si ndǝ ˈyamɗi fǝrandǝ Farta tanda. ˈYamɗi satndiya ɓechan kesh thlaˈtǝ hur nggwalɗi parech har tǝ tanda fartǝɗi nat ndǝ wiˈtǝ ǝ hur chanjeya. Nggwallan paɗ nech kǝ Kǝristi. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Nat nda sǝk ndǝ mbǝn ǝnɗi chandǝ Farta tanda, paɗ, terchan hur nanda chǝndǝ ǝnɗi mbǝnawakchi Farta fa. Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan mǝmatakanda, mǝmatechaˈan chǝk tǝ yenni ǝ hur chanjeya.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Nat ichiɗi sǝɓchiya, chok ndǝ kǝ ǝna chaˈata mǝɗiyamǝn, kǝthlǝm kǝ ɗǝfmǝn wanɗikaɗatˈyamǝn kǝ ɓǝra sǝɓtǝ icha wa, kǝɗ thla chit nda wa. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Kǝ chok wun kǝ fǝ para ɗǝhacha wa, kǝɗ thla chok tǝ fowun hur nanda wa. Kǝɗ ǝnɗi natǝn kǝ yaraɗan hur ndikti Farta ndat wa, “Chok nafchaˈan ha, sǝm kanda, saa kanda, yim kandǝ kǝ rǝɓta tǝ chǝt ichǝ sam samǝn.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Mǝ yim mǝn kǝ tar fǝlaukǝta wa, kǝɗ thla chit fowun hur nanda wa, chich mǝrtǝ nafcha aru kumchit chap nggǝrsi mahkan (23,000), fartǝ arta. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Mǝ kaɗamǝn Chinda wa, kǝɗ ǝnɗi chit fowun hur nanda wa, chich ɓǝlandǝ wuruɓchǝ tanda wa. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Kǝ fathlamǝn mee kǝɗ ǝnɗi chǝt fowun hur nanda wa, chich ɓa thlǝ thlǝndǝ Farta ɓǝlandǝn tanda wa.<verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Ichiɗiya sǝɓchan tǝ kakechmǝn, kǝ chok kǝ saktaˈan mǝɗiyamǝn. Paɗ yaranchi fee ha kǝthlǝm kǝ tǝɗan fee thlǝmechˈyamǝn, nggǝmǝn tǝɗi ɓa yuwa hǝshiɗiya mbǝsamǝn ndǝ ha. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan maa thlǝ sakchowa necho kit kaˈan, chǝko hǝɓakka mǝ hǝminhawa. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Kaɗatsi tamchǝ mbǝswunchǝ, thla sǝnwak tǝ fee ha tǝ cha ndǝ nefa wa. Farta thlǝ ɗǝf mee nakan, nen malanchǝ kǝ kaɗowunchǝ fee thla nech mbǝrandǝ alkǝtˈyowun ha wa, paɗ kǝ ɗar kaɗaɗan, nan inowun mban hǝraˈtǝsi tǝ paɗ kǝ kǝrǝswun.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan, kun tǝɗi yahti, mbǝham langngǝ tǝ para ɗǝhacha. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Nechi ndiktǝ tǝ wunchi, kun tǝɗi kǝsanchǝ hur inchiyowun. Ɗǝpaman kun tǝ iɗiyowun kǝ nowun ǝnɗi thlǝ mbuˈti, ndu kit, ndu ngga kit wa. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Tǝp saaˈem ini yi usoko, thla thlǝ chandǝ mǝn usoko Farta kǝthlǝm ndaˈan, awi ngga ndaˈan thlǝ ɗǝf chǝ mǝnchǝ kǝ namǝn arta hur feri Kǝristi wa? Ɓilsheɗi thlǝ chichendǝ mǝn ha paɗ ngga ndaˈan thlǝ ɗǝfchǝ mǝnchǝ kǝ namǝn arta hur fati Kǝristi wa? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Kǝthlǝm nechamǝn terchan, thlǝ kangchamǝn ɓilshet arta, chokkanmǝn kǝ fat arta.<verse eid="1CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Ɗǝpaman nati nafchi Israˈilawecha. Awi, tandiɗi sǝmcha ɓǝra thle ichiɗi fǝrtǝ fee, ngga tǝ nandǝ chit thlǝrɗakta tǝ thla fǝrandǝ fee thle ɓǝra icha wa? <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Mǝ nati sakta ǝ minni? Ənɗi fǝrandǝ fee ɗǝhata ndaˈan nech kǝ kapa ǝna wa? Ndu ɗǝhataˈan nech kǝ kapa ǝna wa? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Auwa, chǝk ngguɗyeh. Ichiɗi thlǝ fǝrtǝ fǝ para ɗǝhacha yi thle ɓǝracha, tǝthl fǝrandǝ hwaˈarcha, ngga Farta wa. Yah wisi kǝ chok wun nggitkyekta arta tǝ ɓǝɓi shemeta wa. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Mbandǝs natwun sat hur tǝɓ saˈema kǝthlǝm kuɗuktǝ tǝ Chinda Yesu, kǝ nggǝrwun sat hur yi hwaˈarcha wa. Mbandǝs natwun kang ɓilsheta yi kuɗuktǝ tǝ Chinda Yesu, kǝ kang wun yi hwaˈarchǝ paɗ wa. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Ndu tǝ namǝn patandǝ Chinda Yesu kǝ sǝɓan tǝ hwir kaɗ wa? Tǝ pǝɗamǝn ha tǝ alkǝta wa?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chu chǝkamii kǝthlǝm kǝ maanan fee Farta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />“Nat icha nggǝman fee ˈyamǝn,” paɗ ngga nat icha nech tǝ nafu fa wa. “Nat icha nggǝman fee ˈyamǝn,” paɗ ngga nat ichǝ thlǝ tǝnancha wa. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Kǝ ɗǝf yowun hur wun wanɗǝkaɗatsi kǝ ɗar ǝnɗi nech kǝsandǝ indiyansi ndak wa, paɗ kǝ kǝsanchǝ wanmanansi.<verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Kangam nat ǝnɗi thlǝ hǝyandǝ fee kaɗi, mǝt hǝyandǝ thlǝu kaɗi, ngga nwaat kǝ chǝhowun wa, ndu keˈke, ndu ngga keˈke wa. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Kǝthlǝm ndech ndikti Farta wa, “Heshiɗiya tǝ ichiɗi nech huran nat yi Chinmǝn Farta.”<verse eid="1CO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Maa i thlǝ kumi fǝr kit wunchi kǝ sǝm ǝna, yahkowunsi kǝɗuwun, sǝm kowun nat weˈtǝ ǝnɗi fǝrowun ndǝ fee. Sǝmama, ngga tǝ chǝhamee, ndu kimsi, ndu kǝmwasu wa. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Maa ndowunchǝ ˈyowun nefa wa, “Fǝr chǝ fee thle ɓǝra ichiɗiya kǝmɗi ɗǝhacha,” kǝɗu, kǝ sǝmwun wa, kǝthlǝm ɗǝbandǝ maandi nef inni nech mbuˈowun nda, tǝ paɗ shemeta. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Ngga shemetˈyowun nati ndikti kǝ ɗaran wa, paɗ shemeti nafɗi mbuˈowuncha. Kǝthlǝm mǝ naa sakti wanɗikaɗati ˈyowuna ˈyati ǝnɗi yahti chita? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Maa sǝminchi ɗisǝmnan tǝ usoko kǝmɗi Farta, kǝthlǝm mǝ naa fee ˈyara nenchi kǝ ɓǝra ǝnɗi chandi Farta usoko kǝthlǝm ndaˈan? <verse eid="1CO 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan, nat ǝnɗi nat wun chita, ndu sǝmnda, ndu sata, cham chika mǝ nat kǝthlǝm manandǝ Farta. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Kǝ chokwun kǝ ǝna che wan sarti Yahudawecha wa, ndu pong nafcha, ndu nafcha fǝ para Farta. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Cham kǝɗ ǝnɗi thlǝ chiti. Kweˈyamha kǝ ɗǝf wun chikawun kǝ sǝktǝ mbǝnwunfa. Kǝthlǝm nggǝt chit ǝnɗi nech tǝrandǝ wanɗikaɗati nafchǝ ha, ngga kǝthlǝm kǝt indinchi nati chita wa. Thlǝ chichi kǝthlǝm nafchi terchan kǝ mbǝndǝfa, kǝ mbǝsndǝ shishingnda kǝ kweˈkǝchi.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Chaˈam tǝ nenchi, kǝɗ ǝnɗi thlǝ nati chaˈat tǝ Kǝristi.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chaˈandǝ kaɗi kǝ ɓǝra nǝssa kǝ chǝpaandǝ indiyanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Thlǝ nechi chimwunchi kǝthlǝm thlǝ nechowun kuɗuk tǝ, tǝ nggǝta hur chika mǝ. Thlǝ nechowun paɗ kǝs raˈa chaˈanan kaɗ kaˈan, keˈke kǝɗ ǝnɗi chaˈowundi har. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Paɗ yahǝnchǝs kǝ sǝn wun tǝ ndat wa, Kǝristi nech ǝ ɗar chǝka wun nefa, hǝs nef paɗ mǝthlan nech ǝ ɗar nuwan, Farta paɗ nech ǝ ɗar Kǝristi. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Nat hǝs nafɗi nech shenuˈtǝ tǝ Farta, ndu tǝn mbuˈ ǝnɗi mbuˈandǝ Farta chipangkan indiyan, fǝrawa maandǝ thla nech tǝ alkǝtfa ǝ indiyan wa. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Paɗ nat nuɗi nech shenuˈtǝ tǝ Farta, ndu tǝn mbuˈ ǝnɗi mbuˈandǝ Farta, chipawa indiyan wa, tǝ nggirtǝ chimaɗan hacha. Nechan keˈke tǝ nuɗi hǝsandǝ fee indiyan kaɗi. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Maa kar nunef chipandǝ indiyan, hǝsan kan weshiyan kaɗi. Paɗ chok kan wa ǝna hartǝ fata nunef kǝ takantǝ weshiyan ha, ndu kǝ hǝsanchi kaɗ nat. Kǝɗu, chipangkan indiyan.<verse eid="1CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Hǝsnefa kǝm wasi kǝ chǝpan tǝ indiyan wa, kǝthlǝm tǝn kǝ mirshishingnda tǝ maandi Farta. Paɗ nunefa tǝn pǝn maandi chimaɗan. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Ə tǝr kwathl kanan hishnefa ɓawa kesh fi nunefa wa, paɗ nunefa ɓechan kesh fi hisnefa. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Chǝwu fee hishnefa kǝthlǝm nunefa wa, chich fee nunefa kǝthlǝm hishnefa. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Ndaˈan chicha nwaat nunefa kǝ chipantǝ indiyan, kǝ pǝnwa alkǝtsǝ ǝ ɗar indiyan. Kǝthlǝm manandǝ fǝ thlǝnchi Farta.<verse eid="1CO 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Nat tǝkǝɗu, hur Chinda, nunefa mǝthlan samǝn tǝ hishnefa wa. Hishnef paɗ mǝthlan samǝn tǝ nunefa wa. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Kǝɗ ǝnɗi chit fee nunefa fi hishnefa, kǝɗu paɗ nunefa nggǝt chǝ hishnefa. Chǝka mii nat ɓechan mǝɗi Farta. <verse eid="1CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Ɗǝpaman tǝ indiyowun kǝ nowun ǝnɗi kǝmchisi. Nunefa kimsi wa kǝ shenuˈ tǝ Farta indiyan chaˈ wa? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Ə chokheshi pǝnamǝn wa wa, maa mallan hishnef weshiyan njang hǝssa wa kaɗwa, ngga ǝna hartǝfata wa? <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />Nunafɗi naa weshiyan njangnjang, ngga ndǝta kǝmɗiyan wa? Fǝranchǝ fee weshi njangnjang, kǝthlǝm kǝ nggǝlantǝ indiyan. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Maa naa yowun yah as inda kǝ ɓǝra ǝnɗa, nggaˈan sǝn waˈan yowun raˈat samǝn wa. Kǝɗu paɗ nat takǝɗ nggomndi fǝ fǝr kit cha, chǝk tǝ yenni, fen paɗ sǝnwanda wa.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kǝ mananfee saa feri Chinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Kǝ ɗar ndiktǝɗiya paɗ, ǝ chimwi wunchi wa. Maa nggomwun ha kǝthlǝm kǝ manawun Farta, mǝ kǝ kǝsowun chǝsi, nakan chekandǝ sǝɓaandǝ pǝthlǝrwun kaɗi. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Ə tǝrkwathl kanan, sǝkinchi wa maa mggomwun ha, mggomndǝ ha yi fǝ fǝr kit cha, chaktǝs ha pǝthlǝrwun. Yah ki nggǝmandǝ shenuˈtaˈan. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Nwaat kǝ mbǝs fee chak tǝ ha pǝthlǝr wun, kǝthlǝm kǝ sǝn fee, fee nech para Kǝristi yi kit. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Awi, maa nggom wun ha yi sǝm ɗǝsǝmnda, ngga kǝthlǝm kuɗuktǝ tǝ Chinda Yesu wa. <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Ə mǝt sǝm ɗǝsǝmnan, chǝkawuni thlǝ nechan sǝm ɗǝsǝndiyan pǝkwa sheɗan wa. Kǝ malfee yowun ǝ mita, yowun paɗ sakan tǝran kan. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Nggǝ wurchiyowunsi thla natwun chok tǝ ha kǝ sǝmwun kǝ sowun ǝ huran wa wa? Ndu tǝ yah wun njir nafchi Farta wa, kǝ fǝrawun hartǝ fat fee nawak tǝ ǝnˈyandǝs wa? Kǝɗu, mǝnati mbuˈowunda? Kǝ chimi wunchi kǝthlǝm thleya wa? Auwa. Nggǝ chimwunchi wa.<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saa feri Chinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Ənɗi fǝrowunndiya, thlǝchi thlaˈ tǝ mǝɗi Chinda. Ndat wa, Chinda Yesu, ǝ witǝɗi hiyandǝ fee kaɗi, tǝrtǝ njohǝma, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />kǝrsǝ chan usoko Farta, chǝchen kan ha, ndakan wa, “Thlǝya fatǝnchi naa, thla fǝr tǝ fee kǝthlǝm kun. Thlǝ cham kǝɗuyu kǝthlǝm kuɗuktǝ tǝ nenchi.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Kǝɗu paɗ kǝrsǝ sǝm ɗǝsǝmndiyanda, tǝrkan tǝɓ saa ˈyaman, thla naa ˈyam yangngga huran, ndakan wa, “Tǝɓsa ˈyamɗiya mǝthlan pǝnda wa, Farta kǝnantǝ yuwa ɗǝf mee ha tǝ nafcha, tǝmɗi ferinchi. Cham kǝɗuyu nat fartǝɗi nat wun sata, kǝthlǝm kuɗuktǝ tǝnenchi.” <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Kǝthlǝm kǝt ndaˈan, thlaˈtǝ nakanya kǝ fartǝ ɓati Yesu kaɗi, nat fartǝɗi nat wun kang njohǝminɗiya, nat wun paɗ saa ˈyam yangngga tǝɗi nech hur tǝɓsaa ˈyamɗiya. Tǝ nowun ɓaasa ndat wa, Chinda Yesu mǝrchan kǝthlǝm nafchǝ nat.<verse eid="1CO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saa feri Chinda tǝ kumi kǝmwaktǝsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan nat thla kangchǝ nggohǝminɗiya, ndu tǝ saa hur tǝɓ saa emi Chinda tǝ kumi kǝmwaktǝsi, tǝ chantǝ fati Chinda Yesu tǝ ferˈyan, ɓǝɓifat hacha. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Kǝmchansi chika wun nefa kǝ tausan chi indiyan, kǝnan kang njohǝman paɗ kǝ saa hur tǝɓ saa ˈyaman. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Nat thla kang chi njohǝman, saa kan paɗ hur tǝɓ saa ˈyaman ngga tǝ sǝnda wa njohǝman tǝ tǝɓ saa ˈyaman chok chandǝ kǝ kwar fati Chinda tǝ ferˈyan wa, tǝ kaɓan tǝ indiyan chak mee hacha. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Ndaˈan chicha fowun hur wun terchan nech tǝ kumi alkǝtfa, tǝ hatǝfata, fowun paɗ mǝmatinda. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Paɗ maa tausa mǝn indiyamǝn kwaɗǝn kǝ namǝn kangnda, nǝ fee chakamǝnchǝ mee wa. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Maa Chinda thlǝ nech chakamǝn mee tǝ mbanɗiya, tǝn fee tǝɗandǝ thlǝmatˈyamǝn hacha, kǝthlǝm kǝ thlemǝnchi fee chak mee ɓuˈkwa tǝ nafchi heshiɗiya wa.<verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan, wanmanchina, maa nggomwun ha kǝthlǝm sǝm ɗǝsǝmnda, pǝk kowun raˈan. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Paɗ maa yowunsi naa mitǝfiyan, sǝm kan ɗǝsǝmnda ǝ wiri. Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan, maa nggomwun, kǝ kaɓwun chak mee i Chinda indiyowun kafa wa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 11:34">Kǝ ɓǝra takǝɗ ichaˈan paɗ, maa ɓinchi ni shenuˈtǝ kǝ ɗaran.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Fǝr pafǝn i Shemeti Farta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Kǝɗu, nakanya paɗ, wanmanchina, kǝ ɓǝra fǝr pafǝn i Shemeti Farta, yahwesi kǝ chokwun tǝ kumi sǝnda wa. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Sǝnwun wa ǝ fartǝɗi nawak tǝ wun kǝ fǝ kumi fǝr kit cha, lǝm fee wunchi, yimkowun kǝ manandǝ ɗǝhachǝɗi thlǝ shenuˈ wakcha. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan yahǝnchis kǝ sǝnwun tǝ ndat wa, yowunsi nech shenuˈtǝ tǝ alkǝt Shemeti Farta, nech ndat wa, “Yesu sǝɓtǝ nefa wa.” Yowunsi paɗ nech mbahǝn ndat wa, “Yesu Chinda,” Mangga thla naa Shemeti Farta parat har tǝ ndǝ wa.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Kǝɗu, mbǝr ichǝs samǝn samǝn, paɗ Shemet arta thlǝ fǝrchǝ tandǝ nat. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Tarchǝs thlǝ chandǝ fee Yesu samǝn samǝn, paɗ Chinɗi thlǝ chandǝ fee mǝthlan arta. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Mbanchǝs samǝn samǝn thlǝ chǝt fee tarcha, Fartǝɗi thlǝ fǝranchǝ chika wun nef alkǝt chǝt tarchǝ inni nat, mǝthlan arta.<verse eid="1CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Shemeti Farta thlǝ pǝnchan indiyan tǝ mbanchǝ samǝn samǝn ǝ hur chika wun nefa, kǝthlǝm nef ini kǝ chǝt tersi kǝ kǝsantǝ nafchi Fartǝsi. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Yowun fǝranchi fee pafǝn tǝmɗi Shemeta, kǝ shenuˈ ǝ hur mbǝrˈǝna. Kǝmǝn Shemeˈinni, fǝrantǝ yowun alkǝt kǝ chaˈantǝ ǝnɗi kaɗ pǝnandǝ Farta. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Yowun fǝ ranchi fee mbǝrˈǝna yi fǝr kit tǝmɗi Shemeɗiya, yowun paɗ mbǝrˈǝna yi kǝnandǝ nafchi kaɗi tǝmɗi Shemeɗiya. <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Yowun paɗ mbǝrˈǝna yi chit ǝna saka inda. Yowun paɗ mbǝrˈǝna yi mbuˈ ǝnɗi mbuˈtǝ Farta nech sǝɓta. Yowun paɗ yi mbǝr chakandǝ Shemeti Farta ha, tǝ thla nawakchǝ kǝ yi Farta. Yowun paɗ yi mbǝr shenuˈta tǝ wan shenuˈtǝ samǝn samǝn. Yowun paɗ yi mbǝr mbaˈ wan shenuˈcha thla sǝn waktǝ fee. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Nat mbǝr ichiˈini, Shemet arta nech parat tǝ tanda. Mǝthlan paɗ thlǝ chakanchǝ chika wuni kǝɗ thla yahtǝn.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Natmǝn tanggathla fat arta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Kǝɗu, kǝɗ ǝnɗi naa fat arta, tanggathlechǝs terchan. Chika nakan wa tanggathlechˈyan terchan, kǝɗu kǝmndǝ ha kǝ fat arta. Kǝɗu, natǝn tǝ Kǝristi. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Kǝthlǝm natmǝn chamǝn chi fee baptisma tǝmɗi Shemet arta, kǝ hur fat arta. Fowunsi hurmǝn Yahudawecha, fowun paɗ ngga Yahudawecha wa. Fowun mafecha, fowun paɗ ngga mafecha wa. Natmǝn Shemet arta fǝranmǝn ndǝ fee kǝ samǝn.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Fata ngga tanggathlat arta wa, tanggathlech terchan. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Maa naa sartǝ ndat wa, “Kǝthlǝm ngga her nakǝ wa, ngga tanggathla fat naki wa,” thleya nee njanchi sartaˈan choktǝ kǝ tanggathla fata wa. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Kǝɗu paɗ, maa ndi thlǝmata wa, “Nakan wa ngga wenitǝ naki wa, kǝthlǝm ndaˈan ngga tanggathla fat naki wa,” thleya nee njanchi thlǝmaɗan choktǝ kǝ tanggathla fata wa. <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Maa fat nat kǝ wenitǝ ndak, tǝ mǝ naa fee sǝk ndikta? Maa fat nat kǝ thlǝmat ndak, tǝ mǝ naa fee saˈandǝ icha? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Paɗ tahsanchi Farta chika yen tanggathlata ǝ fi fata chǝka yen hurnanda kǝɗ thla yahtǝn. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Maa nat nda tanggathlat arta, mǝ nǝ fat nǝss wa? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Kǝɗ ǝnɗi natǝn, tanggathlechǝs terchan, paɗ fat arta.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Mbandǝs naa wenitǝ nda ndǝ hera wa, “Kǝ mi wu ǝn tǝ wech wa.” Paɗ, mbandǝs naa inda ndandǝ sarcha wa, “Kǝ mi wu ǝn tǝ wunchǝ wa.” <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Ngga kǝɗu natǝn wa, tanggathlechiɗi naa fee kǝɗ nggǝ kwaˈkwaˈ wa, fen naa terˈyandǝsi. <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />Tanggathla fechiɗi thlǝ ɗǝpandǝ mǝn kǝɗ saˈa wa ndǝ taki chaˈan tǝ tera wa, ndaˈan thlǝ manandǝmǝn kaˈan. Tanggathlechiɗi nawakchi ndiˈchan ǝ wenita, ndaˈan thlǝ nggǝrtǝmǝn wuɓaanda. <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />Tanggathlech ˈyamǝn fee nech ndiˈchan ǝ wenita ngga nwaat kǝ chan fee ǝn tanda wa. Paɗ Farta tahsanchi fata, thlǝ fǝranchan maandǝ tanggathlaɗi nawakchi ndiˈchan ǝ wenita. <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />Chich Farta kǝɗu, kǝthlǝm kǝn kumi wum indǝs fi fata wa. Tanggathlechaˈan kǝ ɗǝpandǝ har tǝ raˈan, ɗǝpata weˈtǝ thla arta. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Kǝthlǝm kǝt ndaˈan, maa yowun tanggathlat si mbǝschi mǝrya, nat nda sǝk kandǝ hataˈan ɓukwa, maa kwal fee faa yowun tanggathlat arta hur nanda, nat nda mbǝn kandǝ fat ɓukwa.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Kun nech kǝ fati Kǝristi, chika wun artǝ hur wun paɗ tanggathla fat ˈyan. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Hur nafcha fǝ fǝr kit cha kǝmɗi Farta, ɗǝf Farta nafcha kǝthlǝm tarchǝ samǝn samǝn. Tatǝ kǝmsicha kǝ chok ndǝ ǝ tǝrkwathl kanan. Fǝ shenuˈtǝ tǝ yahti Farta kǝ chok ndǝ kǝ chapataˈan. Fǝ chaˈanchǝ kaɗ paɗ kǝ chok ndǝ kǝ yi mahkanan. Ə kǝrsǝ nanda, fǝ chǝt tar ǝna saka inda, tǝ fǝ mbǝr kǝnandǝ nafchi kaɗi. Mǝ fǝ kǝsandǝ nafchǝsi, tǝ fǝ ɗǝpat har tǝ tarcha, tǝ paɗ fǝ shenuˈcha tǝ wan shenuˈtǝ samǝn samǝn. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Nat ndǝ nech kǝ tatǝ kǝmsicha wa? Nat ndǝ fǝ shenuˈta tǝ yahti Farta wa? Nat ndǝ fǝ chaˈanchǝ kaɗ wa? Ndu nat ndǝ fǝ chǝt tar ǝna saka inda wa? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Nat ndǝ thlǝ chǝt tar kǝnandǝ nafchǝ kaɗ wa? Nat ndǝ thlǝ shenuˈchǝ tǝ michǝ samǝn samǝn wa? Ndu nat ndǝ thlǝ nggǝranchǝ shenuˈtǝ kaɗ wa? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Nakanya ɗǝfam wanɗǝkaɗatsi kǝ kaa fǝr kǝnau pafǝn i Farta, thla nech manchan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Nii pǝnowun mbanɗi nech ndiˈchan nat.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Ndikta kǝ ɓǝra yahraˈan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Chǝka mǝnakan thlǝ mbahǝnchǝ shenuˈtǝ tǝ wan shenuˈti nafcha tǝ yi fǝ thlǝnchi Farta, paɗ maa yahwi nafcha wa, nechi kǝɗ pǝndǝra ndu thlǝbira thla thlǝ ɗakcha nawaktǝ nafuˈyansi. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Ndu thlǝ mbahǝnchǝ mbuˈ ǝnɗi mbuˈtǝ Farta nech sǝɓta. Paɗ thlǝ sǝnchǝ ichiɗi nech ǝ wuɓta kaɗ nat, paɗ sǝn ǝninchǝsi kaˈan, ndu fǝr kit inchǝs kaˈan, thla nati mbahǝn ndandǝ ɗakwan chawa thlaˈu mǝɗa kǝmɗi chikan paɗ. Maa yahwi nafcha wa, kǝɗu, ngga ǝn nakiwa. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Chǝka mǝ kǝ ndǝ fee wa ni mbahǝn fǝr ichiɗi nech inchǝs nat kǝmɗi fǝ ɓahcha, paɗ ni fǝr fatǝnchi kǝ njanfee kaɗi, kǝɗu, maa yahwi nafcha wa, chok wa kǝ mbǝs ǝn har kǝmɗinchi wa.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Yahraˈan thlǝ ɗǝfchan nef kǝ chok tǝ kǝrǝs ǝna tǝ kaakǝta. Yahraˈan sǝkwa sǝraˈta wa, chǝ wa maan inda wa. <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />Chǝ wa thlaˈ inda wa, kweˈ wa ha kǝ ɓǝra ǝnɗi yahtǝ wanɗǝkaɗatˈyan wa, yah wa inda wa, pata wa fata wa, kǝs wa nef har hur wanɗǝ kaɗata wa. <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />Yahraˈan sǝk wa mbǝndǝf maa chǝ nafchǝ ǝnɗi kǝmwakchǝs wa. Paɗ thlǝ tǝranchǝ hwirha maa chǝ fee ǝnɗi kǝmchǝsi. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Yahraˈan thlǝ ɗǝfchan kǝrǝsa ǝ hur chika mǝ nat, fǝr kit kǝ ichi nat, ɗǝf wanɗikaɗata kǝ ichi nat, tǝ paɗ kǝrǝs ǝna hur chika yen mbenna.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Yahraˈan tǝɓawa wa kǝ kwekǝɗan. Thlǝt thlǝnda mǝɗi Farta, nan thlar tǝ ha. Ndiktǝ tǝ wanshenuˈ chǝɗi sǝnwak tǝ fee, nan thlar tǝ ha. Hur inda paɗ, nan tǝɓata. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Kit taˈan, hur indiyamǝn, ngga ndiyiɗan wa. Thlǝnɗi thlǝ thlǝt mǝn mǝɗi Farta ngga ndaˈan nech kǝ ndukwaɗan wa. <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />Fartǝɗi ɓa thla nech kǝ ndiyiɗan, thla nawakchǝ kǝ ndiyiɗan nan thlǝrit tǝ kaɗi. <verse eid="1CO 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Fartǝɗi nati kǝ waa, thlǝ ndikchi kǝɗ waa, thlǝ kaɗǝchi kǝɗ waa, thlǝ nechi icha tǝ wenitǝ wankǝta. Kǝ manki kaɗ paɗ, malanki tar wankǝta. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Kǝthlǝm nakanya ichiɗi thlǝ nat mǝn nakanya kǝ nden wa hur shishingngǝn ema thlǝ nat mǝn nata thliweɗ thliweɗ. Fartaˈan ɓata namǝn nata wenitǝ tǝ wenita. Nakanya sǝndǝnchi ngga ndiyiɗan wa. Fartǝ inni, sǝndǝnchi nan choktǝ kǝ ndiyiɗan. Nan choktǝ kǝ ndiyiɗan kǝɗ thla sǝndǝ Farta nenchi ndiyiɗan.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Kǝɗu, nakanya ichiɗi mahkanya chok ndǝ kǝɗu kǝ kweˈkǝɗan. Fennech kǝ, fǝr kit kǝmɗi Farta, ɗǝf wandǝkaɗata, tǝ yahraˈan. Thla nech manchan hur nandǝ nat, ndaˈan nech kǝ yahraˈan.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s">Ndikta tǝ wanshenuˈta tǝ mbuˈ thlǝndi Farta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Kweyamha tǝ yah nafcha. Paɗ kǝ kweˈwun ha tǝ kaa fǝr ichiɗi thlǝ fǝrandǝ Shemeti Farta nafcha. Kapaɗan yi mbuˈ thlǝndi Farta. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Kǝthlǝm thlǝ shenuˈti tǝ wanshenuˈta thla thlǝ sǝnwaktǝ fee, ngga nafchǝ natǝn shenuˈandata wa, tǝ Farta natǝn shenuˈta. Kǝthlǝm nefsi thlǝ sǝnchǝ ǝnɗi natǝn mbuˈta wa, nakan tǝthl mbuˈtǝ wuɓtǝ icha tǝmɗi alkǝti Shemeta. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Thla thlǝ mbuˈchǝ thlǝndi Farta, tǝn ndiktǝ tǝ nafcha kǝthlǝm kǝ tǝnanchǝ tanda, kǝ chekanchǝ tandǝ alkǝta, kǝ ndǝksanchi wanɗǝkaɗechˈyanda. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Thlǝ shenuˈtǝ tǝ wanshenuˈtǝɗi thlǝ sǝnwaktǝ fee, tǝn tǝnaɗǝ indiyan. Thlǝ mbuˈ thlǝndi Farta, tǝn tǝnadǝ nafcha fǝ fǝr kit cha. <verse eid="1CO 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Karwi fa wa chika wun ǝ hur wun, kǝ mbahǝntǝ shenuˈta tǝ wanshenuˈtǝɗi sǝnwaktǝn. Paɗ ǝnɗi kapati yahta kǝ mbuˈwun thlǝndi Farta. Thla thlǝ mbuˈchǝ thlǝndi Farta pǝɗantǝ thla ha thlǝ ndikchǝ tǝ wanshenuˈtǝɗi sǝnwaktǝn. Maa ngga tǝn yowunsi nech nggǝrandǝ ndiktaˈan kaɗi, kǝthlǝm kǝ tǝnanchǝ nafcha fǝ fǝr kit cha.<verse eid="1CO 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Wanmanchina, nakanya, maa ǝ ɓinchǝ naa ndiktǝ tǝ wunchǝ tǝ wanshenuˈcha, tar mǝ nati chowun nda, maa mbuˈowun wi saktǝ wanshenuˈchaˈan wa? Maa ngga maa ɓinchi tǝ thlǝndi Farta, tǝ sǝn ǝna, tǝ chaˈandǝ kaɗi, ndaˈan nech kǝsowundǝsi. <verse eid="1CO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Kǝɗu natǝn tǝ ichiɗi nawaktǝ shishingndǝ fiyanda kǝɗ shilata tǝ kǝleya. Maa chewu ɓǝratiyandǝ kesh kaˈan wa, kǝn naa yowun sǝn saktǝ ǝnɗi naa fee fǝta ndu peta? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Maa pewu fee ɗiptaˈan ǝ mbanɗi kǝmchǝs wa, wun nech tahǝsfa kǝthlǝm yaanda? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Kǝɗu natǝn paɗ kǝmɗiyowun, maa shǝnuˈwun tǝ miɗi thlǝ sǝnwaktǝ fee, nech fee sǝn ǝnɗi nat wun mbuˈta wa kǝni? Ndikchowun pafǝn kǝɗu hacha. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Miichǝs samǝn samǝn hur heshi, yowunsǝ nawaktǝ sak taˈansǝ wa. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Maa paɗ sǝkwi miiyan wa, chokki kǝ rema kǝmɗi thlǝ ndiktaˈan, thlǝ ndiktaˈan paɗ chok kǝ rema ǝ mǝɗinchi. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Kǝɗu natǝn paɗ mǝɗˈyowun. Nakan wa kun kwalfa mbǝs fǝr icha yi Shemeta, kweˈkowun ha kǝ kowun fǝr icha yi Shemeta, thla nech tǝnandǝ nafcha fǝ fǝr kit cha, kǝ thlarndǝ ha tǝ alkǝtfa.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan nat thla thlǝ ndikchǝ tǝ wanshenuˈtǝɗi sǝnwaktǝ fee, shenuˈkan tǝ Farta kǝthlǝm kǝ fǝran fee sǝnan kǝ mbahǝn tǝ nggǝrandǝ kaɗi kǝ sǝn fee. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Maa shenuˈinchǝ tǝ Farta tǝ wanshenuˈtǝɗi thlǝ sǝnwaktǝ fee, shemetinchǝ nech shenuˈtǝ tǝ Farta, paɗ kaɗatinchi chok wa hur shenuˈtǝ tǝ Fartaˈan wa. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Kǝɗu, mǝ nati chita? Nii shenuˈtǝ tǝ Farta tǝ shemetinchi, tǝ kaɗatinchi paɗ. Nii inˈyamǝs maanandǝ Farta tǝ shemetinchi, nechi chǝt tǝ kaɗatinchǝ paɗ. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Maangga kǝɗu wa, maa cheen Farta usoko tǝ shemetˈyo ndak, kan tǝ kǝni thla nech kǝ yuwa tǝrtǝ ha nech ndat wa, “Kǝ chok kǝɗu” kǝ ɓǝra usoko tǝɗi natu chita, maa sǝn wa ǝnɗi natu mbuˈta wa? <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Chika nakan wa cheen Farta usoko kaˈan, ai, wanmu chek wa tǝ ǝna wa.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Chani Farta usoko kǝthlǝm thlǝ ndikchi tǝ wanshenuˈcha mǝni chika wun hur wun nat. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Nat tǝ kǝɗu, ǝ nggomndi nafcha fǝ fǝr kit, yahchisi kǝ mbuˈi ndikchǝ ɗǝrman tǝ kaɗatinchi kǝthlǝm kǝ chaˈani fowun har, mǝ kǝ mbuˈi ndikchǝ aru kum (10,000) ǝ hur wanshenuˈtǝɗi sǝnwak tǝ fee.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Wanmanchina hǝssa tǝ nǝssa, kǝ chok kaɗatˈyowun kǝɗ yi wan wancha wa. Tǝmɗi chǝt ɓǝɓifata, kǝ chok wun kǝɗ wan waˈyaarcha, paɗ kaɗatˈyowun kǝ chok kǝ yi paktecha. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Nechan kǝ yaraɗan hur Laulawati Farta, ndat wa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">“Ni ndikta tǝ nafchǝɗa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">tǝmɗi wanshenuˈchǝɗi sǝnwak tǝnda, tǝ meˈi ramchǝ paɗ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">Nii ndiktǝ tǝ nafchǝɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">nat tǝ kǝɗu nggandǝ sǝk nenchǝ wa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">nda Chinda.”<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan, ndikta tǝ wanshenuˈtǝɗi sǝnwak tǝ fee, kapa ǝna saka inda kǝmɗi fǝ kumi fǝr kit, ngga kǝthlǝm fǝ fǝr kit cha wa. Mbuˈ thlǝnɗi thlǝt fee mǝɗi Farta, kǝthlǝm fǝ fǝr kit cha, ngga kǝthlǝm fǝ kumi fǝr kit wa.<verse eid="1CO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan, maa ǝ nggom nafcha fǝ fǝr kit cha kǝ mǝt arta. Chikawun paɗ ndikta tǝ wanshenuˈtǝɗi thlǝ sǝnwak tǝ fee, ɓak fee nech kǝ yuwa tǝrtǝ ha, ndu fǝ kumi fǝr kit yimkandǝsi. Awi, nggandǝ nda wa, tǝ tǝrwun kafǝrta wa? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Paɗ maa chikawun mbuˈ thlǝnɗi thlǝt fee mǝɗi Farta, thlǝ kumi fǝr kit, ndu thla sǝnwakchi ǝnɗi nafee chita yimkansi, tǝkan kǝ ndikti chikawun herfa ǝ hur wanɗǝkaɗatˈyan. Maa kǝɗu, ndiktiyowun nat, ɗǝftǝ anchi kǝ tǝr tǝ ha. <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />Wuɓtǝ ǝnɗi nech hur wanɗǝkaɗatˈyan nan chet kesh hayang, tǝ kǝɗu hǝmkan ha, nakan manandǝ Farta, nakan ndat wa, “Kittaˈan Farta ǝ pǝthlǝr wun.”<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kǝ chǝ fee chikami ǝ mbanɗi kǝmchǝsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Kǝɗu, mǝ natmǝn ndat hacha, wanmanchǝna? Fartǝɗi nggomndǝwun ha, yowun ˈyamǝs maanandǝ Farta yansi. Yowun chaˈandǝ ndikti Farta kaɗi, yowun paɗ mbuˈ thlǝnɗi thlǝt fee mǝɗi Farta, yowun ndiktǝ tǝ wanshenuˈtǝɗi thlǝ sǝnwak tǝ fee, yowun paɗ nggǝrandǝ ǝnɗi mbuˈtǝ fee. Mallan kǝ chǝ fee chǝka mǝ nat kǝthlǝm tǝnandǝ nafcha fǝ fǝr kit. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Maa fowun sǝ nech ndikta tǝ wanshenuˈtǝɗi thlǝ sǝnwak tǝ fee, mǝ pǝɗandǝ nef ha chap ndu mahkan wa, kǝ chǝndǝ paɗ artǝ arta, chok nwaat yowun kǝ nggǝranchǝ ǝnɗi mbuˈ tǝ nda. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Maa thlǝ nggǝrandǝ wanshenuˈtaˈansi kaɗ wa, chǝkawun hur nanda nggaskan ɓaˈ hur nafcha fǝ fǝr kit. Kǝ ndik tǝ Farta hur wanɗǝkaɗatˈyan ndak.<verse eid="1CO 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Fǝ mbuˈ thlǝnɗi thlǝt fee mǝɗi Farta, chokkan nafchǝ chap ndu mahkan kǝ ndik nda, kaɗankǝ fowun ha hur nanda saktǝ ǝnɗi mbuˈtǝ feyu. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Maa fǝran Farta thla ɗas hur wun sǝn ǝnɗi thlǝ mbuˈtǝ fee, thla tǝr kwathl kanan nech ndiktiyu nggas kan ɓaˈ. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Nat wun thlǝ mbahǝnchowun mbuˈ thlǝnɗi thlǝt wun mǝɗi Farta artǝ arta, thla naa chǝkawun mbǝs chaˈata, kǝ ndǝkǝsfa paɗ.<verse eid="1CO 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Nat thla thlǝ thlǝch thlǝnda mǝɗi Farta, alkǝtˈyansi kǝ ɓǝra shemetˈyan. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Kǝthlǝm Fartiyamǝn ngga Farta thla thlǝ sakech ha wa, thlǝ yahchan kǝ chok fee hur hashas kǝta.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Nechan kǝɗu paɗ hur nat nafcha fee chǝɗchǝɗ i Farta, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />kǝmchansi nǝssa kǝ nggasndǝ ɓaˈ hur nggomnda. Kǝthlǝm fǝrawu fee tandǝ mbandǝ kǝ shenuˈ nda wa. Kǝ parandǝ tǝ kusiˈ tǝɗi mbuˈtǝ Musa. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Ma ǝnsi yahtǝndǝ sǝnda, kǝɗu, chahan kandǝ hǝsǝyandǝ ǝ wiri. Kǝthlǝm ǝna hartǝfata nunefa kǝ shenuˈ hur nggomndi fǝ fǝr kit cha.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Ə ɗar indiyowun nggak tǝ ndikti Farta wa? Ndu nggun ichǝtwun saˈtǝ ndiktaˈan kǝmɗiyowun wa? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Maa artǝs hur wun yowunsi thlǝ kaɗech wa thlǝ thlǝt thlǝnda nakan mǝɗi Farta, ndu thlǝ fǝrti Farta yi shemeta, kǝɗu, sǝnkan tǝ ndat wa, ǝnɗi nati yarowundǝs ya ǝnɗi mbuˈtǝ Chinda Yesu tǝ indiyan. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Maa ǝ kar yowun ndǝ mbat har tǝ thleya, mǝthlan paɗ kǝ nggǝmwun ndǝ fa wa.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan, wanmanchina, ɗǝfam wanɗǝkaɗatsi kǝ mbuˈ thlǝnɗi thlǝt fee mǝɗi Farta, mǝ ˈyatowun ndiktǝ tǝ wanshenuˈtǝɗi thlǝ sǝnwak fee wa. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Kǝ chǝ fee chikami ǝ mbanɗi kǝmchisi. Kǝ chǝ fee artǝ arta.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s">Thlaˈti Kǝristi ǝ mǝrta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Nakanya, wanmanchina, ni kuɗukowun kusheˈtǝ kwastǝ ndiktǝɗi ɓasowundisi, thla thlǝtwun natwun parat paɗ. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Tǝmɗi kusheˈtǝ kwastǝ ndiktiˈini thlǝ mbǝstǝ wun hǝraˈta, tǝ shishingnda kǝ kweˈkǝchi, maa chok wa thlǝ kǝs chowun ndiktaˈan har kaˈan thla ɓasowundisi. Mangngga kǝɗu wa, fǝr kit ˈyowun mere.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Ndiktǝɗi nech kǝ kittaˈan thla thlǝti, ndaˈan furowundi. Ndat wa, Kǝristi mǝrchan kǝthlǝm ɓǝɓifechˈyamǝn. Kǝɗ ǝnɗi natǝn kǝ yaraɗan hur Laulawati Farta. <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />Ndat wa thlohan fee, thlaˈan kǝ fee ǝ mǝrta far mahkanda, kǝɗ ǝnɗi natǝn kǝ yaraɗan hur Laulawati Farta. <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />Paɗ pǝn tǝ fat kǝmɗi Kefas, kǝnan nggǝr pǝn fat kǝ takǝɗ kum nggǝrsi chaptaˈan. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Kǝrsǝ ndaˈan, pǝn tǝ fat kǝmɗi wanmancha fee mbǝranchi kum chit kum ɗǝrman ha (500). Tertǝnanda paɗ peˈndǝ ha tǝ shishingnda, fowun paɗ hur nanda mǝrnda. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Kǝrsǝ ndaˈan, pǝn tǝ fat kǝmɗi Yakubu. Kǝnan nggǝr pǝn indiyan paɗ kǝmɗi tatǝ kǝmsichiyan nat. <verse eid="1CO 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Ə ndukwaɗan nat, pǝn tǝ fat kǝmɗinchi. Chika nakan wa nggǝt nafɗi nggǝt tǝ fee, fartǝɗi kǝmwakchisi.<verse eid="1CO 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Kǝthlǝm nggǝt nech ngguɗyeh hur tatǝ kǝmsichi Kǝristi. Kǝmwasi kǝ i fee nenchi wa tatǝ kǝmsha i Kǝristi wa. Kǝthlǝm ɓahani nafcha fǝ para mbanchi Farta. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Paɗ kǝthlǝm kaakǝti Farta chokti kǝɗ ǝnɗi nati, kaakǝt ini chitǝn yu ngga mere wa. Thla chich pǝɗandi chikayen hur tatǝ kǝmshichi Kǝristi ha, tǝ tera, chika ndaki kǝɗu ngga nggǝt chǝt taran wa, Farta chicha tǝmɗi kaakǝtˈyan tǝmɗinchi. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Kǝɗu, ndu nggǝta, ndu tanda mbuˈowunchi kwastǝ ndikta yi sǝktaˈan, ndiktaˈan arta. Kun paɗ fǝr wun kitsi.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thlaˈti nafcha ǝ mǝrta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Ma fee ɓaasa ndat wa, thlaˈan fee Kǝristi ǝ mǝrta, mǝchicha thlǝ nda fowun hur wun wa, thlaˈti mǝmatechǝs wa? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Maa thlaˈtǝs ǝ mǝrta wa, pǝnchansǝ wa, thlaˈa wu fee Kǝristi ǝ mǝrta wa hacha. <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />Maa thlaˈa wu Kǝristi ǝ mǝrta wa, awi, ɓasiyaˈan kǝmɗi nafcha mere, fǝr kit ˈyowun paɗ mere. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Chokchan wa tǝ naˈan lekandǝ Farta kaf hacha wa, kǝthlǝm thlǝ nechaˈan ɓaasa wa, Farta thlaˈantǝ Kǝristi ǝ mǝrta. Maa chok wa kit thlaˈtǝs, ǝ mǝrta wa, pǝnchansǝ wa thlaˈa wa Kǝristi ǝ mǝrta wa hacha. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Kǝthlǝm maa thlǝ thlaˈa wu fee mǝmatecha wa, awi, chika Kǝristi maa thlaˈa wu fee ǝ mǝrta wa hacha. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Maa thlaˈa wu fee Kǝristi paɗ wa, awi, fǝr kit ˈyowun mere wa, paˈya nggun hur ɓǝɓifechˈyowun. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Awi, fee thlich Kǝristi kǝnandǝ mǝrta, tǝ mǝrndǝ poriˈ hacha wa. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Maa ɗǝf wanɗǝkaɗat ˈyamǝn kǝ Kǝristi kǝthlǝm naaɗi ha hur heshiya ndak, awi, chok mǝn kǝ ǝna ai kaˈan mǝ takǝɗ nafcha.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Kittaˈan, thlaˈan Farta Kǝristi ǝ mǝrta. Mǝthlan nech kǝ tǝrkwathl kanan hur fee mǝrcha, thla thlaˈandǝ fee ǝ mǝrta. Chok kǝɗ nǝha tǝrkwathl kanan thla fǝrandǝ fee Farta. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Kǝɗ ǝnɗi natǝn wa ɓech mǝrta tǝmɗi nefa, kǝɗu paɗ thlaˈtǝ ǝ mǝrta ɓechan tǝmɗi nefa. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Nakan mǝrchǝ nafchǝ nat tǝmɗi Adamu, nech nafchǝ nat thlaˈtǝ paɗ nat tǝmɗi Kǝristi. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Ne chok wuweluˈawa. Chika wuni naa fee thlaˈanda arta kǝrsǝ arta. Kǝristi nech kǝ tǝrkwathl kanan, fartǝ ɓatˈyan kaɗi fee fǝr chǝ kit kǝ anchi fen paɗ nandǝ thlaˈta. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Kǝn ndukwaɗan ɓata, kǝrsǝ fǝran Chinan Farta kutǝrakta. Nan fǝr kutǝraktaˈan kǝrsǝ wellandǝ kutǝrakta, tǝ manda, tǝ alkǝta. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Kǝthlǝm nwaat kǝchǝ Kǝristi kutǝrakta, har kǝ saˈ fartǝɗi naa Farta ɗǝf atǝkrechiyan kǝ kan sarchiyan. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Atǝkrekǝɗ ɗi nafcha naa fee paˈandǝ kaɗ ǝ ndukwaɗan, mǝthlan nech kǝ mǝrta. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Chokchan kǝɗ ǝnɗi yarandǝ fee ha hur Laulawati Farta ndat wa, “Farta ɗǝfti chikamǝ nat kǝ kan kutǝrakti Waˈyan.” Kǝ yaran kǝ fee kǝɗu, pǝnchan wa nat icha nandǝ kaa thlǝmat ha kǝ Yesu, ngga Farta nech koptǝ ha pangngǝn Yesu wa, kǝthlǝm Farta nech ɗǝf ichǝ nat kǝ kan kutǝraktiyan. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Kǝrsǝ ɗǝf chikamǝ nat kan kutǝraktiyan. Wanan tǝ indiyan nan fǝr indiyan kǝmɗi Farta, thla fǝrtǝn ichǝ nat kǝ harˈyan. Kǝthlǝm Farta kǝ wathlanchi ha wa mǝthlan nech kǝ chikamǝ tǝ mii.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Maa ngga kǝɗu wa, mǝ nech kǝ sakti nafchǝɗa, fee chandǝ fee baptisma tanda kǝ kǝthlǝm mǝmatecha? Maa nggǝ thlaˈti mǝmatechǝs wa, kǝthlǝm mǝ thlǝ chandǝ fee nafcha baptisma kǝthlǝm tanda?<verse eid="1CO 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Maa nggǝ thlaˈti mǝmatechǝs wa, kǝthlǝm mǝ paɗ thlǝ natmǝn ɗǝf indiyamǝn kǝ hur kuɓa shishingndǝ chǝk yen wanshengnda? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Wanmanchina, nggǝt mbuˈowunda, nggǝt mǝrta chik yen parta. Ni mbahǝn mbuˈtǝ kǝɗu tǝ alkǝta, kǝthlǝm sǝnɗi nessǝnchǝ tǝ wunchǝ hur Kǝristi Yesu Chǝnmǝn. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Fartǝɗi nati Afisa, nafchǝ terchan karndǝ ndiktinchi. Kǝnden wa kǝɗ tǝ yani tǝ thlǝu hur hwalichǝɗi nech tǝ yandǝf kaˈan. Kǝɗu maa thlaˈti mǝmatechǝs wa, mǝ nech nat kǝ chektaˈan inchi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:32">“Ngga nakamǝn sǝmnda tǝ sata wa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:32">nakan, ǝssi namǝn mǝrta?”<verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Kǝ lǝm fee wunchǝ wa. “Choktǝ tǝ ɓǝɓi nafcha, thlǝ sǝɓanchan nafchǝɗi kaɗ naa hur inchiyandǝsi.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Mbam kaɗ kǝ hur inchiyowun ndiˈchan. Kǝ ɗǝwun kǝ pang tǝ chǝt ɓǝɓifata wa. Kǝthlǝm fowun hur wun sǝnwandǝ Farta wa. Mbaˈchi kǝɗu kǝthlǝm kǝ harowunchǝ fata.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thlaˈtǝ ǝ mǝrta hur fata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Maˈ kǝ chǝh yowun nef mee kǝ nda wa, “Kǝn naa nafɗi mǝrcha thlaˈtǝ ǝ mǝrta? Tǝ weˈtǝ faami natǝn thlaˈta?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Chǝ ɓam nefa, ǝnɗi hǝftu, nwaat kǝ mǝr kwaɗǝn kǝnan tǝfta. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Ənɗi hǝftu paɗ, nggen tif kesh tǝ faɗi hǝftu wa. Weˈtǝ ndak natu hǝfta, ndu yi hwerma, ndu tǝ weˈtǝ samǝn. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Paɗ Farta thlǝ fǝranchǝ wanan saˈchiyan kǝɗ thla yahtǝn. Chika yen wanan tǝ weˈtǝ saˈchiyan. <verse eid="1CO 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Ngga nat fata weˈtǝ arta wa. Nafcha weˈtǝ yinandǝsi. Ɗǝparecha tǝ weˈtǝ yinanda. Ɗǝngchǝ tǝ weˈtǝ yinanda. Yirǝfchǝ paɗ tǝ weˈtǝ yinanda. <verse eid="1CO 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Weˈtǝ fatsi yi hulafǝrta, neˈsǝ paɗ weˈtǝ yi hur heshi. Yi hulafǝrta, maandiyansi, yi hur heshi paɗ, maandiyansi samǝn. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Watfarta maandiyansi samǝn. Ndǝr paɗ maandiyansi samǝn. Wanndǝr paɗ maandiyansi samǝn. Yowun wandǝra maandiyansi, yowun paɗ tǝ maandiyan samǝn.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Kǝɗu natǝn tǝ thlaˈta ǝ mǝrta. Faɗi naa fee thlohanda, ǝna thla nech mǝthlǝ kaɗi. Faɗi naa fee thlaˈanda ǝ mǝrta, mǝthlan mǝthl wa kaɗ wa. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Fartǝɗi naa fee thlohandǝ faɗan maandiyansǝ wa, fartǝɗi naa fee thlaˈanda nan choktǝ tǝ maanda. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Thlǝ thlohanchi fee fata yi tapta, thlǝ thlaˈanchi fee fata yi Shemeta.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 15:44">Nakan fatsi yi heshiɗiya, kittaˈan fatsi yi Shemet paɗ. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Kǝɗu natǝn kǝ yaraɗan, “Farta tǝntǝ Adamu thla fǝrandǝ fee shishingnda tǝrkwathl kanan.” Chapatǝ Adamu paɗ, mǝ thlan nech kǝ Shemeta thla thlǝ fǝranchǝ nafchǝ shishingnda. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Ngga fata yi Shemeta nech kǝ tǝrkwathl kanan wa, paɗ fata yi nafkǝta lech natsi, kǝn yi Shemeta. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Tǝrkwathl kan nefa tǝ taptǝ haaha chǝt fee ndi. Chapatǝ nef paɗ thlaˈtǝ hulafǝrta ɓatǝn. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Kǝɗ ǝnɗi naa nafɗa kǝ taptǝ haaha, kǝɗu nafchiɗi nech kǝ yi tapta, nechandǝ kǝɗ mǝthlan. Keɗ ǝnɗi naa nafɗa kǝ yi hulafǝrta, kǝɗu naa nafchiɗi nech kǝ yi hulafǝrta nechandǝ choktǝ kǝɗ mǝthlan. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Kǝɗ ǝnɗi tǝr tǝmǝn fata yi nafɗi tǝndǝ fee tǝ tapta, kǝɗu paɗ natmǝn tǝr fati nef ini thla nech hulafǝrta.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Ənɗi thlǝ mbuˈowundi hacha, wanmanchina, faaɗi tǝndǝ fee tǝ tapta thla naa fer fiyan, nggen yim kǝ maandi Farta wa. Ngge chǝ wa, chǝk ngguɗyeh. Kǝɗu paɗ thla thlǝ mǝthlchi kaɗi, ngge sǝm kǝrsǝ mǝrtǝ maandi thla thlǝ mǝthlǝ wakchi kaɗ wa.<verse eid="1CO 15:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Kam thlǝ mat haa, ni mbuˈowun wuɓtǝ ǝna yowun. Ngga nat mǝn nech mǝrta wa, paɗ natmǝn naa fee mbeɗandǝ fat ˈyamǝn ha. <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />Nechan choktǝ kǝɗ pǝthl wiɗ tǝ wenita, tǝ sǝk ɓǝratǝ mbeembeta yi ndukwaɗan. Kǝthlǝm naa fee peendǝ mbeembeta, mǝmatecha nandǝ thlaˈta tǝ weˈtǝ faaɗi thlǝ mǝthl wakchi kaɗi. Nggamǝn paɗ naa fee mbeɗandǝ fat ˈyamǝn ha. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Kǝthlǝm faaɗiyamǝn ya thla thlǝ mǝthlchi kaɗi, nwaat kǝ chok kǝ thla thlǝ mǝthl wakchi kaɗi. Faaɗi thlǝ mǝrchǝ paɗ nwaat kǝ chok kǝ faaɗi thlǝ mǝrwak cha. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Paɗ ǝ fartǝɗi mbeɗa faaɗi ha thla thlǝ mǝthlchi kaɗi kǝ chok kǝ thla thlǝ mǝthlwakchi kaɗi. Fat paɗ thla thlǝ mǝrcha kǝ chok kǝ thla thlǝ mǝrwakcha. Kǝn ndiktǝɗi nech kǝ yaraɗan hur ndikti Farta nan ndiiɗ ha. Thla yarandǝ fee ndat wa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:54">“Mbǝs fee alkǝt kǝ ɓǝra mǝrta.”<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />Mǝrta, ai alkǝtˈyo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:55">Chǝ, mǝrta, ai haftiyo thla thlǝ chetu nafchisi?<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Ai, ɓǝɓifaɗi thlǝ chǝt nafcha ndaˈan thlǝ ɓech tǝ mǝrta. Ɓǝɓifat paɗ thlǝ mbǝschan alkǝt tǝmɗi kusiˈ tǝɗi fǝrtǝ Farta. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Paɗ sǝku kǝ ndiiɗ usoko ha kǝmɗi Farta, thla thlǝ fǝranmǝnchi alkǝt kǝ ɓǝra mǝrta tǝ ɓǝɓifata, tǝmɗi Chǝnmǝn Yesu Kǝristi.<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan, wanmanchina fee yahti, nggǝt mbuˈowun nda, thlaramha tǝ alkǝtfa. Kǝ ɗǝf ǝnwunchǝs kǝ mbuhowun kaɗ mǝɗi natwun wa. Chǝk yen parta, kǝnowun kweˈtǝ ha hur tarɗi thlǝ chandǝ wun Chinda Yesu. Kǝthlǝm sǝnwun wa tarɗi thlǝ chǝtwun kǝthlǝm Chinda ngga pafǝn wa.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s">Nggom icha kǝthlǝm fee fǝrchi kit kǝ Farta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Kǝɗu, kǝ ɓǝra nggom icha kǝthlǝm kǝsandǝ nafchisi fǝ fǝr kit cha kǝmɗi Farta, fee nech ǝ Urshelima, cham kǝɗ ǝnɗi mbuˈandi nafchiɗi nech hahi Galatiyawecha kǝ chǝnda. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Ə chǝka yen tǝrkwathl kan parta yi mǝndǝ muɗ, chǝka wun hur wun kǝ ɗǝf tǝ ǝn ha kǝ kǝlar keˈke tǝ alkǝtˈyan. Kǝthlǝm yah wisi kǝ nggom fee ǝna fartǝɗi ɓati wa. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Maa saˈinchi, nii thlǝn fee fǝr tǝ wun kit kǝ tanda, ɓukwa tǝ yarata. Kǝ ɗǝndǝ tǝ fǝr kǝnau pafǝn ˈyowun kǝ Urshelima. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Maa ndiˈchansi nggǝt paɗ kǝ ɗi, kǝɗu, pǝɗakandǝ ɓukwa tǝ nenchi.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tahǝsfa yi wiˈta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Nii wiˈyowun ndǝfa, maa wiˈyani hahichi Makidoniya, kǝthlǝm harinchifa nii parat tǝ Makidoniya. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Maˈya kǝ mǝnii ɗǝmok ǝ mǝɗˈyowun, ndu kǝ choki tǝ wunchi kǝ tǝp fekta. Kǝthlǝm kǝ kǝsichǝ wunsǝ tǝ ǝnɗi yahti, yi wiˈtinchi thlaˈtǝ mǝɗa, kǝ mǝɗi nati ɗǝta. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Yah wisi kǝ niwunchi nakanya kǝ mbǝriha ndak wa, auwa, yahchisi kǝ mǝnii ɗǝmok tǝ wunchi. Maa nggǝman Chinda Yesu. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Nakanya nii thlartǝ ha ǝ Afisa, kǝ mbǝr fartǝ Pentakos (Mǝndǝ kum chǝt ɗǝrman kǝrsǝ mbǝnfa tathlǝ ha). <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />Kǝthlǝm ini chǝ Farta kapa mbandǝsi, kǝthlǝm kǝ chi tarɗi nech nat tǝ naafu fa, paɗ atǝkrechinchǝs terchan. <verse eid="1CO 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Maa ɓi Timoti, ɗǝfam ndǝ kǝ kaltǝ fat ha hur wun, kǝthlǝm mǝthlan maa tǝri Chinda natǝn chita kǝɗ ǝnɗi nati chita. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan kǝ njir yowun ndǝ wa. Kǝ kǝsawunsi tǝ ǝna wiˈta, maˈnan ɓak kaɗ kǝmɗinchi hur hashas kǝta. Nggǝt tǝ wanmancha, nggaˈan pǝk ɓatˈyan kaɗi. <verse eid="1CO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Nakayan, kǝ ɓǝra wanmanmǝn Apolos paɗ, nggǝt shiyandǝ kaˈan kǝ ɓǝ kǝmɗiyowun tǝ takǝɗ wanmancha, kǝthlǝm yah wa ɓat nakan yawa. Nan ɓat fartǝɗi mbǝstǝn mbanda.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndukwa ndikti Bulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Kǝ chok wun tǝ tahǝsfa, kǝ thlarwun ha hur fǝrkit ˈyowun, kǝ pǝparowun ha wa, thlaram ha tǝ alkǝta. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Nat ǝnɗi nat wun chǝta, kǝ chǝwun hur kafata.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Kǝthlǝm ndaˈan wanmanchina, sǝnwun sǝwa nafchǝɗi nech hur wiri Istifanus fen nech kǝ tǝrkwathl tǝrtǝ ha ǝ hur hahi Akaya. Fǝrndǝ indiyanda kǝ ɓǝra chan ter Farta. <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />Nggǝt shiyowunda kǝ fǝrawun maandǝ weˈtǝ nafchiˈini. Kǝ fǝrawun maandǝ shikechi tarchi ˈyamǝn fee nech saa ɓahtǝ tǝ mǝnchi.<verse eid="1CO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Chǝnchi mbǝnfata tǝ ɓati Istifanus, tǝ Fartunatus, tǝ Akaikus. Ɓatˈyanda, chichǝf kǝɗ kun ɓech kǝmɗinchi. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Tǝrandǝ wanɗǝkaɗatinchi ha, kǝɗ ǝnɗi tǝrandǝ ndǝ wanɗǝkaɗatˈyowun ha. Weˈtǝ nafchiɗa kǝmchǝs kǝthl kuɗuk fee tǝ tanda, hur nggomndi nafcha.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Nafcha fǝ fǝr kit kǝmɗi Farta yi hahi Asiya tandǝ ndowun ǝn fa. Akila tǝ nuwan Biriskila, tǝ takǝt nafcha fǝ fǝr kit kǝmɗi Farta, fee nggomchǝ ha ǝ wirˈyanda, tandǝ ndowun ǝn fa kaˈan hur thlǝm Chinda Yesu. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Nat wanmanchǝmǝn tǝɗi mǝɗa, tandǝ ndowun ǝn fa. Kǝ ndawun ǝn raˈanfa hur yahraˈan kǝɗ wanchi Farta. <verse eid="1CO 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Nggǝt Bulus, nech yarowun ndaˈǝniɗasi tǝ herinchi.<verse eid="1CO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Nat thla thlǝ mbǝn wakchǝ kafat kǝ Chinda Yesu, kǝ sǝɓan Farta kaɗi. Ɓo kaha Chinda Yesu.<verse eid="1CO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Kaakǝti Chǝnmǝn Yesu, kǝ chok tǝ wunchi. <verse eid="1CO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Kafaɗi nessinchi kǝthlǝm kun hur Kǝristi Yesu, kǝ chok tǝ wunchi. Kǝ chok kǝɗu.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>